msgstr "Ils doivent être occupés pour le moment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I don't feel well enough."
msgstr "Je ne me sens pas assez bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
