msgstr "J'ai déjà un animal de compagnie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
