msgid "I'm sure there's a perfectly scientific explanation for that."
msgstr "Je suis sûr qu'il y a une explication scientifique à ce phénomène."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "What a lucky find!"
msgstr "Quelle belle trouvaille !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "That's a prettier axe than I'm used to."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas l'habitude de manier une si jolie hache."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "How did this tree even reproduce?"
msgstr "Comment cet arbre a-t-il pu se reproduire ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Quit staring."
msgstr "Arrête de me fixer comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "It makes me look even brighter than usual."
msgstr "Ça me donne l'air encore plus brillant que d'habitude."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "It's incredibly tough. I could use this!"
msgstr "C'est incroyablement robuste. Ça pourrait m'être utile !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "I'm moonlighting as a tailor."
msgstr "Tout ce travail me rend lunatique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "Crystallized illuminosity."
msgstr "Une lueur cristallisée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "All that science hiding inside... and I can't get to it!"
msgstr "Dire qu'elle contient tant de science... et je ne peux pas l'atteindre !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "It doesn't seem to care about personal space."
msgstr "Elle est du genre tactile, non ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "It has a prickly disposition."
msgstr "Elle pique ma curiosité !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "Just the place to make something very clever and scientific."
msgstr "C'est l'endroit idéal pour faire quelque chose de très intelligent et scientifique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "A simple combination of elements!"
msgstr "Il suffit d'assembler des éléments, c'est simple !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "It must have come through that strange rift!"
msgstr "Il a dû sortir de cette faille bizarre !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
msgid "This formed part of its crown."
msgstr "Ça faisait partie de sa couronne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "It's so alluring."
msgstr "Tellement charmant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "Now I can start my very own meat farm."
msgstr "Je vais pouvoir lancer ma propre ferme à viande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "Is there any trumpetfisk?"
msgstr "Un vrai plat de Viking !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "Sanity is a small price to pay for science!"
msgstr "La santé mentale n'est pas chère payée pour la science !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "Why am I starting to feel a bit uneasy...?"
msgstr "Quel est ce malaise qui m'envahit ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "A fowl beast indeed!"
msgstr "Comme il est gauche et veule !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "Smells fishy."
msgstr "Ça sent le poisson."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "Plucked from a fine feathered fiend."
msgstr "Arrachée à une bête redoutable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "I'm making a quill-t!"
msgstr "Le vent va nous voler dans les plumes !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He's trapped!"
msgstr "Il est piégé !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Mandrake roots have strange properties."
msgstr "Les racines de mandragore ont d'étranges propriétés."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "Well, he won't be waking up again."
msgstr "Bien, elle ne se réveillera plus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "Cut it out!"
msgstr "La ferme !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "It doesn't seem so strange anymore."
msgstr "Elle n'a plus l'air si bizarre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "I've heard strange things about those plants."
msgstr "On raconte des choses bizarres sur cette plante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "I feel a lil better when I hold one."
msgstr "Je me sens un peu mieux quand je tiens ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "A blank map. Doesn't seem very useful."
msgstr "Une carte vide. Probablement pas très utile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "Fancy!"
msgstr "Beau !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "I traded the old family cow for it."
msgstr "J'ai donné la vieille vache de la famille pour avoir ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "It looks carved."
msgstr "Ça a l'air sculpté."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "I think I could use that."
msgstr "Je crois que ça pourrait me servir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "Makes sense to me."
msgstr "Ça me paraît logique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "I don't think an axe will cut it."
msgstr "Une hache ne le coupera pas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "That's burning fast!"
msgstr "Ça brûle vite !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "One less thorn patch to worry about."
msgstr "Des épines en moins !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks thorny."
msgstr "Il y a plein d'épines."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Ouch."
msgstr "Ouille !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "It's a plant."
msgstr "C'est une plante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Spikes and fire!"
msgstr "Des épines et du feu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Now it's burnt and spiky."
msgstr "Maintenant il est brûlé et piquant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Not so spiky now!"
msgstr "Bien moins piquant maintenant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Those spikes look sharp!"
msgstr "Ces épines ont vraiment l'air pointues !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES"
msgid "I've heard cooking is basically chemistry. I should try it."
msgstr "J'ai lu que la cuisine n'est que de la chimie. Je devrais essayer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT"
msgid "I don't see the resemblance."
msgstr "Je ne vois pas la ressemblance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT"
msgid "I wouldn't bug her."
msgstr "Mieux vaut ne pas lui chercher des puces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT"
msgid "It looks heavier than the others."
msgstr "Celui-là a l'air plus lourd que les autres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT"
msgid "It's a blacksmith mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque de forgeronne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT"
msgid "It's a cracked doll mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque cassé de poupée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT"
msgid "It's a doll mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque de poupée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT"
msgid "It was a doll mask at one point."
msgstr "C'était un masque de poupée... à un moment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT"
msgid "It's a fool's mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque de bouffon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT"
msgid "Seems a bit dull."
msgstr "Ça paraît un peu bête."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT"
msgid "It's a King mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque de roi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT"
msgid "It's a mask, but it looks like a mirror."
msgstr "C'est un masque, mais on dirait un miroir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_PRINCESSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_PRINCESSHAT"
msgid "Hay, princess!"
msgstr "Bonjour, princesse !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT"
msgid "It's a Queen mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque de reine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT"
msgid "Looking sharp."
msgstr "Ça donne un air aiguisé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT"
msgid "Should I just play along?"
msgstr "Faut-il que je joue le jeu ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT"
msgid "It's a tree mask."
msgstr "C'est un masque d'arbre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST"
msgid "Avast! A mast!"
msgstr "Mille sabords ! Un mât !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM"
msgid "I'm full of bright ideas."
msgstr "Je déborde d'idées lumineuses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD"
msgid "I'm full of bright ideas."
msgstr "Je déborde d'idées lumineuses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD"
msgid "Aww, just look how its eyes light up when it sees me!"
msgstr "Oh, regarde, ses yeux s'illuminent quand elle me voit !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM"
msgid "I've harnessed the power of electricity over land and sea!"
msgstr "J'ai maîtrisé le pouvoir de l'électricité sur terre et sur la mer !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM"
msgid "Now I can build a mast."
msgstr "Je peux faire un mât, maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS"
msgid "Spread my wings and sail away!"
msgstr "J'étends mes ailes en je m'envole sur l'eau !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM"
msgid "It's lighter than it looks."
msgstr "C'est plus léger que ça en a l'air."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD"
msgid "That's one scaly sail."
msgstr "C'est une belle voile couverte d'écailles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM"
msgid "Now I can build a mast."
msgstr "Je peux faire un mât, maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "I hate that guy."
msgstr "Je déteste ce mec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "I can see into his pores."
msgstr "Je peux voir jusque dans ses pores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "I wonder how they work."
msgstr "Je me demande comment ça marche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "Looks almost like a key hole."
msgstr "On dirait presque une serrure."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "So that's where the music was coming from."
msgstr "C'est donc de là que venait la musique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "That doesn't look very comfortable."
msgstr "Ça n'a pas l'air très confortable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "It's a bit gamey, but it'll do."
msgstr "Ça sent le gibier, mais ça ira."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "It's just a big wad of meat."
msgstr "C'est juste un gros morceau de viande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "The rack got dried."
msgstr "L'étendoir est bien sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "Jerky time!"
msgstr "À la viande !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "In laboratory terms, we would call that \"dry\"."
msgstr "En termes scientifiques, on peut dire que c'est « sec »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "Meat takes a while to dry."
msgstr "La viande est longue à sécher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Meat takes even longer to dry in rain."
msgstr "La viande est encore plus longue à sécher quand il pleut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Rain, rain, go away. Be wet again another day."
msgstr "Il pleut, il mouille, c'est la fête à la grenouille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Drying things is not an exact science."
msgstr "Sécher des choses n'est pas une science exacte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "I should dry some meats."
msgstr "Je devrais sécher de la viande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT"
msgid "The rack got dried."
msgstr "L'étendoir est bien sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE"
msgid "Jerky time!"
msgstr "À la viande !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "In laboratory terms, we would call that \"dry\"."
msgstr "En termes scientifiques, on peut dire que c'est « sec »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING"
msgid "Meat takes a while to dry."
msgstr "La viande est longue à sécher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Meat takes even longer to dry in rain."
msgstr "La viande est encore plus longue à sécher quand il pleut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Rain, rain, go away. Be wet again another day."
msgstr "Il pleut, il mouille, c'est la fête à la grenouille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Drying things is not an exact science."
msgstr "Sécher des choses n'est pas une science exacte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Those look like they could use some meat."
msgstr "Il faudrait peut-être un peu de viande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED"
msgid "It dried its best."
msgstr "Personne n'est venu à son sec-ours."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT"
msgid "The rack got dried."
msgstr "L'étendoir est bien sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE"
msgid "Jerky time!"
msgstr "À la viande !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "In laboratory terms, we would call that \"dry\"."
msgstr "En termes scientifiques, on peut dire que c'est « sec »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT"
msgid "Sodium salty."
msgstr "Une pointe de sel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING"
msgid "Drying takes time."
msgstr "Sécher prend du temps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Drying takes even longer in rain."
msgstr "C'est encore plus long à sécher quand il pleut."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Rain, rain, go away. Be wet again another day."
msgstr "Il pleut, il mouille, c'est la fête à la grenouille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Drying things is not an exact science."
msgstr "Sécher des choses n'est pas une science exacte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC"
msgid "These really are drying times."
msgstr "C'est comme regarder la peinture sécher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD"
msgid "Strangely filling, for a salad."
msgstr "C'est étonnamment copieux pour une salade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Just jerky enough."
msgstr "Juste séchée comme il faut"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE"
msgid "It will let everything know I'm here. Everything."
msgstr "Tout saura bientôt que je suis ici. Absolument tout."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "Smells fishy!"
msgstr "Ça sent le poisson !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT"
msgid "It won't fit me. It's a merm helmet."
msgstr "Ça ne m'ira pas. C'est un casque merm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT"
msgid "It won't fit me. It's a merm helmet."
msgstr "Ça ne m'ira pas. C'est un casque merm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That smell is the worst."
msgstr "L'odeur est abominable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "A merm has died."
msgstr "Un merm à terre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Dead merm waking!"
msgstr "Un merm mort-vivant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD"
msgid "I feel very guarded around these guys..."
msgstr "Je suis toujours sur mes gardes près de ceux-là..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR"
msgid "The next phase of merm evolution."
msgstr "La prochaine phase de l'évolution merm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW"
msgid "Just a shadow of their former self."
msgstr "Ce n'est plus qu'une ombre de lui-même."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT"
msgid "Finally, I can show my face in public."
msgstr "Je peux enfin montrer mon visage en public."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt merm flesh somehow smells even worse."
msgstr "La chair de merm brûlée sent encore plus mauvais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "The stinkiest thing I'll smell all day."
msgstr "Le truc le plus puant que j'aie senti aujourd'hui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Nothing to live in, now."
msgstr "Inhabitée pour l'instant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Who would live here?"
msgstr "Qui peut vivre là-dedans ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "Ugh, the smell!"
msgstr "Argh, quelle odeur !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "It's actually kind of cute."
msgstr "C'est plutôt mignon, en fait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "Your Majesty!"
msgstr "Votre Majesté !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "There was something fishy about that throne anyway."
msgstr "Il y avait anguille sous roche avec ce trône, de toute façon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks fit for a swamp king!"
msgstr "Digne d'un roi des marais !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "I suppose we'll never know what it was for now."
msgstr "J'imagine qu'on ne saura jamais ce que c'était."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "Just what is she planning?"
msgstr "Mais qu'est-ce qu'elle mijote ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "A royal guard with no Royal to guard."
msgstr "Un garde royal sans roi à garder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "They seem happy to have found a king."
msgstr "Ils ont l'air heureux d'avoir trouvé un roi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "It says \"Mermfolk Ownlee.\""
msgstr "C'est écrit « Raieservé aux merms »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "It says \"Mermfolk Ownlee.\""
msgstr "C'est écrit « Raieservé aux merms »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "The next phase of merm evolution."
msgstr "La prochaine phase de l'évolution merm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "They operate on a first-come, first-sovereigned basis."
msgstr "Premier arrivé, premier à régner. C'est comme ça que ça marche, ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW"
msgid "Just a shadow of their former self."
msgstr "Ce n'est plus qu'une ombre de lui-même."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL"
msgid "It does so much, badly."
msgstr "Ça fait beaucoup de choses, mais très mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "I don't think I'll find anything scientific in there."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas que je trouverai des choses scientifiques ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "I don't think I'll find anything scientific in there."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas que je trouverai des choses scientifiques ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "This tool looks a little fishy."
msgstr "Cet outil sent un peu la marée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "I wonder if it's for me!"
msgstr "Je me demande si c'est pour moi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "It's full of nothing."
msgstr "C'est plein de vide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "It won't pull any muscles now."
msgstr "On n'aura plus de risque de crampes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "I think I pulled a muscle just looking at it..."
msgstr "La regarder suffit à me donner des crampes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "...Ew."
msgstr "... Beurk."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "A hands-free way to brighten your day."
msgstr "De la lumière avec kit mains libres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "How illuminating!"
msgstr "Comme c'est lumineux !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "Somehow the breeze comes out the back twice as fast."
msgstr "Je sais pas pourquoi ça accélère le vent comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "I can light it to let everyone know I'm here."
msgstr "Je peux l'allumer pour que tout le monde sache que je suis là."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "I could draw better than that!"
msgstr "Je pourrais dessiner bien mieux que ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "We should draw something on there."
msgstr "On devrait dessiner quelque chose là-dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "It's not much use like this. We should place it."
msgstr "Ça ne sert pas à grand-chose comme ça. Il faudrait le mettre quelque part."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "That thing doesn't look happy."
msgstr "Il n'a pas l'air heureux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "It may contain a bigger something fantastic! Or horrible."
msgstr "Ça pourrait contenir un truc fantastique plus gros ! Ou atroce !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "Wow! I'm glad that didn't gore me!"
msgstr "Waouh ! Heureusement qu'il ne m'a pas encorné !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD"
msgid "It's gone cold."
msgstr "C'est froid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess those mites weren't just full of hot air."
msgstr "Ces mites ne devaient pas être remplies que d'air chaud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED"
msgid "I cooked it... but do I really want to eat it?"
msgstr "Je l'ai cuite... mais est-ce que j'ai envie de manger ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "I'd sure like to whack that mole... thing."
msgstr "J'aimerais vraiment vermifuger cette... taupe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "Nowhere left to dig, my friend."
msgstr "T'as fini de creuser, mon ami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Something's under there, searching for minerals."
msgstr "Il y a un truc là-dessous, ça cherche des minéraux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT"
msgid "A regular Noseferatu."
msgstr "C'est un vampif ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL"
msgid "I wonder what might be stuck in that rat's nest."
msgstr "Je me demande ce qu'il y a dans ce nid de rats."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "A wretched stench, but excellent visibility."
msgstr "Une odeur affreuse, mais excellente visibilité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "What a nice, homey hole in the ground!"
msgstr "Quel joli petit trou habitable !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Curious little guy."
msgstr "Étrange petit bonhomme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "Did that just move?"
msgstr "Ça vient de bouger ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT"
msgid "Like I said!"
msgstr "C'est bien ce que je disais !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Treehouses are terribly flammable places to conduct experiments."
msgstr "Les cabanes arboricoles sont des endroits excessivement inflammables pour y mener des expériences."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL"
msgid "Nothing can get in, but it keeps spitting things out."
msgstr "Rien n'y entre, et pourtant, il crache sans arrêt des choses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS"
msgid "This machinery looks oddly familiar..."
msgstr "Ces débris me disent quelque chose..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR"
msgid "A real pillar of the community."
msgstr "Un vrai pilier de la communauté."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN"
msgid "She looks like the top banana around here."
msgstr "C'est la banane la plus mûre du régime, à mon avis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "I wonder if they're edible? Maybe an experiment is in order."
msgstr "Je me demande si c'est comestible ? Hm, une expérience s'impose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT"
msgid "I think it makes me look very dashing and captain-like."
msgstr "Un vrai capitaine ! Et pas le plus moche, pas vrai ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT"
msgid "At least it will keep my hair dry."
msgstr "Au moins, mes cheveux resteront au sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "It's an affront to science."
msgstr "C'est un affront à la science !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Ugh. I don't think I should eat that."
msgstr "Pouah... Je ne devrais pas manger ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Strange-smelling jerky."
msgstr "Viande séchée à l'odeur étrange"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "There's got to be something else to eat around here."
msgstr "Il doit y avoir autre chose à manger par ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "It's all smashed up."
msgstr "C'est tout cassé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "There's a hole in the middle for something to go in."
msgstr "Il y a un trou au milieu pour y mettre quelque chose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "The stone lit it up somehow."
msgstr "On dirait que la pierre s'allume."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Now what?"
msgstr "Et alors ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "I have a distinct feeling this isn't right."
msgstr "Quelque chose me dit que ce n'est pas normal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "My vast scientific knowledge tells me it's... a moon butterfly."
msgstr "Ma vaste culture scientifique me dit que c'est... un papilune."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "I've got you now."
msgstr "Je t'ai attrapé !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "We're really winging it now."
msgstr "On va pouvoir filer à tire-d'aile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "A moth turned into a tree? Lunacy!"
msgstr "Un papillon qui se transforme en arbre ? C'est l'œuvre d'un lunatique !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "There's no moon down here to measure."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de lune ici pour rivaliser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Water amplifies the science, allowing us to measure the moon."
msgstr "L'eau augmente la science, ce qui nous permet de mesurer la lune."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED"
msgid "I have the strangest feeling I'm being watched."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression qu'on m'observe..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "It's a full moon."
msgstr "C'est une lune pleine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "It's a new moon."
msgstr "C'est une nouvelle lune."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon is waning."
msgstr "La lune décroît."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon is waxing."
msgstr "La lune croît."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER"
msgid "only_used_by_woodie"
msgstr "only_used_by_woodie"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "It's very sharp."
msgstr "C'est très tranchant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "I've made it extra effective."
msgstr "Je l'ai rendue super efficace."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED"
msgid "I should put this to scientific use before the energy fades!"
msgstr "Je devrais l'utiliser pour faire des expériences avant que son énergie se dissipe !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "I can practically see my reflection in it."
msgstr "Je peux presque me voir dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "It's a chunk of moonglass with Lunar Wobsters in it."
msgstr "C'est un bout de verrelune avec des womards lunaires dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "I should stick something shiny in it. For research."
msgstr "Je devrais y mettre un truc qui brille. Pour la recherche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "I only worship science."
msgstr "Je n'idolâtre que la science."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "That rock came from the moon."
msgstr "De la roche qui vient de la lune."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "There's science inside!"
msgstr "Il y a de la science dedans !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "I could probably break that."
msgstr "Je pourrais sans doute casser ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "That's not a normal spider den."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas un nid d'araignée normal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's glassy."
msgstr "C'est... transparent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED"
msgid "It's glowing with unearthly energy."
msgstr "Ça brille d'une énergie surnaturelle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Of course! Combining moon energy with potato energy, why didn't I think of that?"
msgstr "Mais oui ! Il suffit de combiner l'énergie de la lune à l'énergie de la patate ! C'est évident."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK"
msgid "I think I'll call it the \"Higgsbury Particle.\""
msgstr "Je pense que je vais l'appeler « particule de Higgsbury »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC"
msgid "A new discovery, how electrifying!"
msgstr "Une nouvelle découverte ! C'est électrifiant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER"
msgid "There's nothing inside."
msgstr "Il n'y a rien dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM"
msgid "It makes my hair do crazy things."
msgstr "Mes cheveux font n'importe quoi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER"
msgid "It seems lost in transmission."
msgstr "Il semble y avoir un problème de transmission."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm? What did you say?"
msgstr "Hmm ? Qu'est-ce que vous dites ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "It wants to be finished."
msgstr "Il veut être achevé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL"
msgid "It seems to be part of a larger mechanism."
msgstr "Ça a l'air d'appartenir à un mécanisme complexe..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "It feels like it's waiting for something."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression qu'il attend quelque chose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "I fished it up, now to find a fissure!"
msgstr "Je l'ai repêchée, il n'y a plus qu'à trouver une faille !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "It doesn't want to be on the ground."
msgstr "Ça ne veut pas rester par terre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON"
msgid "I think I know just where you belong."
msgstr "Je crois que je sais où te mettre, toi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "I feel compelled to carry it somewhere."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression de devoir l'emmener quelque part."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK"
msgid "It must be building up to something."
msgstr "Ça a l'air d'accumuler de l'énergie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "There's something trapped inside."
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose de piégé dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "There's something trapped inside."
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose de piégé dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "There's something trapped inside."
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose de piégé dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "It wants me to give it a home."
msgstr "Elle veut que je lui trouve un foyer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD"
msgid "It wants to be with the others."
msgstr "Il veut rejoindre les autres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP"
msgid "It doesn't look particularly appetizing."
msgstr "Ça n'a pas l'air très appétissant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "The things I do in the name of science..."
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'on ne ferait pas pour la science..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1"
msgid "The science has only just started."
msgstr "La science ne fait que commencer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2"
msgid "That's looking much more science-y already!"
msgstr "C'est déjà plus scientesque !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's containing the energy! I knew what it was for all along, of course."
msgstr "Ça contient de l'énergie ! Hum, je le savais depuis le début."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "My brain pulses with peace and terror."
msgstr "Mon esprit est envahi par la paix et la terreur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "The cracks in this place are starting to show."
msgstr "Les failles de cet endroit commencent à se voir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "It's not very scientific... but pretty effective."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas très scientifique... mais c'est efficace."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning!"
msgstr "L'arbre brûle !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "The tree burned down."
msgstr "L'arbre a brûlé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "That was a pretty thick tree."
msgstr "C'était un gros arbre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "I didn't know trees grew on the moon."
msgstr "Je ne savais pas que les arbres poussaient sur la lune."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "It fell from the moon tree."
msgstr "C'est tombé de l'arbre lunaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED"
msgid "Nice dry."
msgstr "C'est tout sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "I don't exactly know what that thing is."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas vraiment ce que c'est."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "The babies are like excited electrons trying to escape."
msgstr "Les bébés sont comme des électrons excités qui veulent en sortir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "It puts its babies there."
msgstr "C'est là qu'ils mettent leurs bébés."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "He's as talented a chef as I am a scientist."
msgstr "C'est un chef aussi talentueux que je suis scientifique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "Disgusting little bloodsucker."
msgstr "Dégoûtant petit suceur de sang."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "Hey, is that my blood?"
msgstr "Hé ? C'est mon sang ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB"
msgid "I'm just itching to throw it."
msgstr "J'ai trop envie de la jeter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER"
msgid "Apparently plants like it."
msgstr "Apparemment, les plantes aiment ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE"
msgid "It's the latest buzz among the merms."
msgstr "Apparemment, ça fait le buzz chez les merms."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK"
msgid "Those suckers will never get me!"
msgstr "Ces bestioles ne m'auront jamais !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "It's probably someone else's blood..."
msgstr "C'est sans doute le sang de quelqu'un d'autre..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Aaah! You are definitely not an electron!"
msgstr "Ah ! T'es vraiment pas un électron !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "He probably deserved it."
msgstr "Il l'a sans doute bien cherché."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "I bet there's all sorts of good stuff down there!"
msgstr "Je parie qu'il y a plein de trucs bien par ici !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "This punch has a kick to it."
msgstr "Ce punch a du... punch."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "This ought to be a scientific impossibility."
msgstr "C'est censé être une impossibilité scientifique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "I'm sure there's some scientific explanation for this."
msgstr "Il y a forcément une explication scientifique à tout ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "It's brilliant!"
msgstr "C'est brillant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME"
msgid "It might be aggressive, but only sporeradically."
msgstr "Ça peut être agressif, mais ce n'est qu'occasionnel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "A mushroom cloud in the making!"
msgstr "Un nuage champignon en formation !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "Makes the wearer look like a fun guy."
msgstr "Celui qui portera ça aura l'air marrant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "How im-morel!"
msgstr "Comme c'est immoral !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "How scientific!"
msgstr "Comme c'est scientifique !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "The power of science compelled it."
msgstr "Le pouvoir de la science s'est imposé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "It could use a spore. Or a mushroom transplant."
msgstr "Il pourrait avoir besoin d'une spore. Ou d'une transplantation de champignon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "The mushrooms have really taken to the log."
msgstr "Les champignons ont vraiment colonisé la bûche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "The log is dead. We should replace it with a live one."
msgstr "La bûche est morte. Il faudrait en remettre une vivante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "I don't think it can grow in this cold."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas que ça va pousser par ce froid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "It should keep growing now."
msgstr "Ça devrait continuer à pousser maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "That's a lot of mushrooms!"
msgstr "Ça fait beaucoup de champignons !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Comboletely burnt."
msgstr "Totalement carbonisé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "It's a big, science-y 'shroom."
msgstr "C'est un gros scienti-champi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Science makes it light up."
msgstr "C'est la science qui l'allume."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "I didn't mildew it, I swear."
msgstr "Je jure que ce n'est pas ma faute."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "We could make a prime light source with some primary colors."
msgstr "On pourrait en faire une excellente source de lumière, avec des couleurs primaires."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "Blue is obviously the most scientific color."
msgstr "Le bleu est évidemment la couleur la plus scientifique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "It's covered in acid."
msgstr "C'est recouvert d'acide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "I'm mildly offended by this."
msgstr "Je trouve ça légèrement offensant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "These used to grow in my bathroom."
msgstr "Il en poussait dans ma salle de bain."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON"
msgid "This mushroom tree is clearly stranger than the rest."
msgstr "Cet arbre champignon est nettement plus étrange que le reste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "It's covered in acid."
msgstr "C'est recouvert d'acide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "It's trying to reproduce."
msgstr "Il essaie de se reproduire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A magic mushroom?"
msgstr "Hallucinogène ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "It's covered in acid."
msgstr "C'est recouvert d'acide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "You can't tell from far away, but it's quite smelly."
msgstr "Dès qu'on s'en approche, on comprend que ça sent assez fort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "That mushroom got too big for its own good."
msgstr "Ce champignon est devenu trop grand, c'est mauvais pour lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "It's covered in acid."
msgstr "C'est recouvert d'acide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC"
msgid "The spiders thought this one was important."
msgstr "Les araignées devaient trouver ça important."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER"
msgid "Things are about to get hairy..."
msgstr "Cette histoire ne m'a pas l'air au poil..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD"
msgid "I suppose it's a rare bird."
msgstr "J'imagine que c'est un oiseau rare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE"
msgid "Don't mind me, just carrion eating."
msgstr "Fais pas gaffe à moi, continue à manger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC"
msgid "I admire its dead-ication."
msgstr "J'en suis presque mortifié."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
msgid "It's got a little something in its eye."
msgstr "Il a un petit quelque chose dans l'œil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD"
msgid "Now I can breathe easy."
msgstr "Je peux enfin respirer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "Science save us!"
msgstr "La science nous sauvera !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
msgid "I have a very strong desire to run."
msgstr "J'ai très, très envie de courir, là."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG"
msgid "What big, glowing eyes you have!"
msgstr "Comme tu as de grands yeux brillants !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD"
msgid "That's the end of that."
msgstr "Bon ben. Kaput."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "That thing's terrifying!"
msgstr "Cette chose est terrifiante !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Thank goodness. It's sleeping."
msgstr "Ouf, il dort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER"
msgid "Ah, I... just ate! Why don't you give it to one of your spider friends?"
msgstr "Ah, je... je viens de manger ! Et si tu donnais ça à tes amies araignées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER"
msgid "Ah, I... just ate! Why don't you give it to one of your spider friends?"
msgstr "Ah, je... je viens de manger ! Et si tu donnais ça à tes amies araignées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER"
msgid "Oh wow, that looks um... delicious, Webber!"
msgstr "Oh ouah ! C'est... ça a l'air délicieux, Webber !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON"
msgid "Oh wow, that looks um... delicious, Webber!"
msgstr "Oh ouah ! C'est... ça a l'air délicieux, Webber !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER"
msgid "Ah, I... just ate! Why don't you give it to one of your spider friends?"
msgstr "Ah, je... je viens de manger ! Et si tu donnais ça à tes amies araignées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR"
msgid "Oh wow, that looks um... delicious, Webber!"
msgstr "Oh ouah ! C'est... ça a l'air délicieux, Webber !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER"
msgid "Oh wow, that looks um... delicious, Webber!"
msgstr "Oh ouah ! C'est... ça a l'air délicieux, Webber !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "You really can't go wrong with flowers."
msgstr "Les fleurs, c'est toujours une valeur sûre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT"
msgid "No more bedhead for this scientist!"
msgstr "Voilà qui devrait maintenir mes cheveux en place !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "It gives off a spooky light."
msgstr "Ça produit une lumière inquiétante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "This stuff is crazy!"
msgstr "Ce truc est dingue !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH"
msgid "Those crystals might be cause for some concern."
msgstr "Ces cristaux risquent de poser problème."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "I wonder what function this served."
msgstr "Je me demande à quoi ça servait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE"
msgid "It's a little spooky."
msgstr "C'est un peu effrayant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "All is well."
msgstr "Tout va bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "The nightmare is almost gone!"
msgstr "Le cauchemar est presque parti !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "There's no magic around here."
msgstr "Aucune magie par ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "It seems to be staying steady."
msgstr "On dirait que ça reste régulier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "Feels like it's receding."
msgstr "On dirait que ça s'évanouit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "Getting pretty magical around here."
msgstr "Ça devient magique par ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "It's becoming more concentrated!"
msgstr "Je crois que ça se concentre de plus en plus !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "It's electric!"
msgstr "C'est électrique !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Why would anyone make this? It's terrifying."
msgstr "Qui peut oser faire des trucs pareils ? C'est terrifiant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "I'm not a geologist."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas géologue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION"
msgid "It's definitely some kind of rock."
msgstr "C'est un genre de minéral. J'en suis sûr."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT"
msgid "It's quite gripping!"
msgstr "On s'y attache vite !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED"
msgid "Now we're really gaining some traction!"
msgstr "On va enfin pouvoir avancer !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT"
msgid "This will help me see all the science hiding in the dirt."
msgstr "Ça me permettra de distinguer la science dans la terre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OAR"
msgid "Manual ship acceleration."
msgstr "Accélérateur manuel du navire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD"
msgid "Manual ship acceleration."
msgstr "Accélérateur manuel du navire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY"
msgid "It really puts the paddle to the battle."
msgstr "De quoi vous mettre du vague à la rame."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's dry as a bone."
msgstr "C'est à sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that a mirage?"
msgstr "Est-ce un mirage ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
msgid "Just some muddy grass."
msgstr "De l'herbe boueuse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL"
msgid "The fish will have a ball with this."
msgstr "Les poissons vont bien s'amuser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY"
msgid "Say y'ello to my little friend!"
msgstr "Rira bien qui canari-ra le dernier !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW"
msgid "I'd rather eat fish than crow."
msgstr "Je préfère manger des poissons que des corbeaux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE"
msgid "You're going down, fish!"
msgstr "Le poisson ne m'échappera pas !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS"
msgid "Where there's a quill, there's a way."
msgstr "La plume est plus forte que l'appât."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE"
msgid "A bobber might improve its accuracy."
msgstr "Un bouchon devrait améliorer sa précision."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL"
msgid "Those fish won't give me the slip this time!"
msgstr "Ces poissons ne s'échapperont pas, cette fois !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN"
msgid "Hopefully it won't attract any red herrings."
msgstr "Espérons que les poissons ne verront pas rouge."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "The snowbird quill helps me stay frosty."
msgstr "La plume d'oiseau des neiges me permet de garder la tête froide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY"
msgid "My brain is protected by a thick layer of hard science!"
msgstr "Mon cerveau est protégé par une épaisse couche de science !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY"
msgid "This feels a bit heavy handed."
msgstr "Ça me paraît un peu exagéré..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN"
msgid "Soaking myself might help me think like a fish..."
msgstr "M'immerger devrait m'aider à réfléchir comme un poisson."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW"
msgid "The fish won't snow what hit them!"
msgstr "Les poissons ne vont rien voir venir !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE"
msgid "Some fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "Certains poissons devraient trouver ça appâ-tant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN"
msgid "Some fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "Certains poissons devraient trouver ça appâ-tant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED"
msgid "Some fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "Certains poissons devraient trouver ça appâ-tant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE"
msgid "Some smaller fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "Certains petits poissons devraient trouver ça appâ-tant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN"
msgid "Some smaller fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "Certains petits poissons devraient trouver ça appâ-tant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED"
msgid "Some smaller fish might find this a-luring!"
msgstr "Certains petits poissons devraient trouver ça appâ-tant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD"
msgid "Now this is the reel deal!"
msgstr "C'est de la super canne !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1"
msgid "I certainly hope it tastes better than it looks."
msgstr "J'espère que c'est meilleur que ça en a l'air..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
msgid "I went to a lot of treble to catch it."
msgstr "J'ai eu du mal à le remonter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3"
msgid "I wasn't lion about my aptitude for fishing!"
msgstr "Je me suis vraiment décar-rascassé pour le pêcher !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4"
msgid "I'm sure this won't bring me any bad luck."
msgstr "Je suis sûr qu'il ne me portera pas malheur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5"
msgid "This one seems kind of corny."
msgstr "Il a un épi sur la nageoire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6"
msgid "Now that's the real McKoi!"
msgstr "Carpe diem !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7"
msgid "Now that's the real McKoi!"
msgstr "Carpe diem !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8"
msgid "Ice bream, youse bream."
msgstr "Je lui ai pourtant tendu la perche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9"
msgid "That's the sweet smell of a successful fishing trip."
msgstr "Ah, j'aime l'odeur du poisson tout juste pêché au petit matin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1"
msgid "Looks like the runt of its school."
msgstr "Il est resté sur les bancs de l'école, lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2"
msgid "I won't win any bragging rights with this one."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas lutter avec celui-là."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3"
msgid "It's a bit on the small side."
msgstr "Il est un peu petit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4"
msgid "A fish this size won't tide me over for long."
msgstr "Un poisson de cette taille ne me calera pas longtemps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5"
msgid "I can't wait to pop it in my mouth."
msgstr "J'ai hâte qu'il m'explose en bouche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6"
msgid "You have to sea it to beleaf it."
msgstr "Il feuille le voir pour le croire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7"
msgid "I finally caught this bloomin' fish!"
msgstr "J'ai enfin pêché ce poisson... cette fleur... ce poisson ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8"
msgid "It's a scorcher!"
msgstr "Tout feu tout flamme !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9"
msgid "Just spit-balling, but I might have a use for you..."
msgstr "J'espère qu'il ne va pas cracher dans la soupe..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE"
msgid "I think these trees are a little lost."
msgstr "Je crois que ces arbres sont un peu perdus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT"
msgid "There's something alive inside."
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose de vivant, là-dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "It's not quite as great as the original, but still pretty good."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas aussi beau que l'original, mais c'est déjà pas mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE"
msgid "The scientific term is \"tree noodles\"."
msgstr "Le terme scientifique pour cette chose c'est « nouilles d'arbre »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON"
msgid "What if I just gave it a little poke?"
msgstr "Il se passe quoi si on le tapote ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT"
msgid "I smell burnt toast."
msgstr "Ça sent le toast brûlé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT"
msgid "I sea debris."
msgstr "Une mer de débris."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL"
msgid "I'll give it a whirl."
msgstr "C'est une très grosse chasse d'eau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT"
msgid "It caught something!"
msgstr "Il y a quelque chose dedans !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED"
msgid "Looks like something was caught, but it escaped..."
msgstr "Mh, on dirait que ce qui s'était pris dedans s'est échappé..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED"
msgid "All ready to catch fish again!"
msgstr "C'est prêt pour les poissons suivants !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "It makes fishing more effishient."
msgstr "De quoi faire un sacré coup de filet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED"
msgid "And now we wait."
msgstr "Et maintenant, attendons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT"
msgid "I should put it somewhere with lots of fish."
msgstr "Je devrais le mettre là où il y a beaucoup de poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC"
msgid "It's so sad and kelp-less..."
msgstr "Il paraît si triste sans son varech..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "Kelpious amounts of seaweed!"
msgstr "Une quantité de varech algue-hurissante !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP"
msgid "I think I could fit some more kelp in there."
msgstr "Je pense que je peux encore ajouter du varech."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC"
msgid "It's so sad and kelp-less..."
msgstr "Il paraît si triste sans son varech..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "Kelpious amounts of seaweed!"
msgstr "Une quantité de varech algue-hurissante !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP"
msgid "I think I could fit some more kelp in there."
msgstr "Je pense que je peux encore ajouter du varech."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "We should add a beefalo bell."
msgstr "On devrait ajouter une cloche de bœufalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION"
msgid "Looks crunchy."
msgstr "Ça a l'air croquant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "A successful chemical reaction."
msgstr "Une réaction chimique réussie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED"
msgid "They grow up so fast! It's... it's bringing a tear to my eye."
msgstr "Ils grandissent si vite ! Ça... Ça me donne les larmes aux yeux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of odd seeds."
msgstr "Une poignée de graines bizarres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "This gem seems special."
msgstr "Cette gemme a l'air spécial."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "It's scientifically proven that gems look better on top of sticks."
msgstr "Il est scientifiquement prouvé qu'une gemme est plus belle au bout d'un bâton."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "Teleportation can be so useful."
msgstr "La téléportation, ça peut être super pratique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It's an orange gem."
msgstr "C'est une gemme orange"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "No one could get lost with that thing looking out for them."
msgstr "Impossible de se perdre quand ce truc nous surveille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "This beats walking."
msgstr "C'est mieux que la marche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTER"
msgid "You should see the otter guy."
msgstr "Vous verriez loutre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Otter den that, there's not much else there."
msgstr "Loutre ce nid, il n'y a pas grand-chose d'autre ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT"
msgid "I otter have a closer look."
msgstr "Je vais regarder ça à la loutre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD"
msgid "We are taking on a l'otter water."
msgstr "Ça fait beaucoup d'eau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "Kind of piney, for a palm tree."
msgstr "C'est une pomme de palmier ? Une paume de pin ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "It has big dreams of being a tree one day."
msgstr "Il rêve de devenir un grand arbre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "If trees had toenails, I imagine they'd look like this."
msgstr "Si les arbres avaient des orteils, je pense qu'ils ressembleraient à ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "The very beginnings of a tree."
msgstr "C'est le tout début d'un arbre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "It may contain something fantastic! Or horrible."
msgstr "Ça pourrait contenir un truc fantastique ! Ou atroce !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "This Yuletide bread really rose to the occasion."
msgstr "Ce pain de Nouvel An est parfait pour l'occasion."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "To serenade the animals."
msgstr "Pour faire la sérénade aux animaux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "Some sheets of paper."
msgstr "Des feuilles de papier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "I lova good Pavlova."
msgstr "J'adore la pavlova."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "That spit is corrosive!"
msgstr "C'est corrosif !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Must be breeding season."
msgstr "Ça doit être la saison des amours."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That's what I call a firebird."
msgstr "Est-ce qu'il renaîtra de ses cendres ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I call fowl."
msgstr "Un volatile, à première vue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's becoming a new species!"
msgstr "Il devient une nouvelle espèce !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Nice and spicy."
msgstr "C'est bon. Et ça pique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "What a mouthful!"
msgstr "On en a plein la bouche !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "It was already hot to begin with."
msgstr "Ça piquait déjà au départ, mais là..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A pepper of rather unusual size."
msgstr "Ce poivron est légèrement plus grand que la moyenne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of seeds."
msgstr "Une poignée de graines."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Stupid bird! Stay away from those berries!"
msgstr "Crétin d'oiseau ! Laisse mes baies tranquilles !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's inordinately large."
msgstr "C'est excessivement gros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That won't do at all."
msgstr "Ça va pas le faire du tout."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I've got to plant something there."
msgstr "Je dois planter quelque chose ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel like it wants something."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression qu'il veut quelque chose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "These turned out pretty good."
msgstr "C'est plutôt réussi en fait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Sure showed those flowers who's boss!"
msgstr "Ces fleurs ont vu qui était le patron !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED"
msgid "Nice dry."
msgstr "C'est tout sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "I'm not sure I want to hold those."
msgstr "Est-ce qu'il faut vraiment prendre ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED"
msgid "Nice dry."
msgstr "C'est tout sec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "It looks scared stiff."
msgstr "On dirait que c'est raidi par la peur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "It's thick and pliable. And salty."
msgstr "C'est épais et flexible. Et salé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH"
msgid "Oh no, I've seen THAT before."
msgstr "Oh non, j'ai déjà vu ce MACHIN."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "Iconic, isn't it?"
msgstr "Emblématique, pas vrai ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Smashing!"
msgstr "Et bim !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "You won't be herring any complaints from me."
msgstr "Ça a un goût assez m-hareng."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "What are you looking at?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu regardes comme ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "He's got gold fever!"
msgstr "Il a la fièvre de l'or !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Here's mud in your eye!"
msgstr "Tiens, de la crotte plein les yeux !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Wouldn't you rather hit someone else?"
msgstr "Tu voudrais pas aller cogner quelqu'un d'autre ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "What are you looking at?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu regardes comme ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "He's got gold fever!"
msgstr "Il a la fièvre de l'or !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Here's mud in your eye!"
msgstr "Tiens, de la crotte plein les yeux !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Wouldn't you rather hit someone else?"
msgstr "Tu voudrais pas aller cogner quelqu'un d'autre ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "He doesn't look as friendly as the others."
msgstr "Il n'a pas l'air aussi sympa que les autres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "This little piggy's gone... \"home\"."
msgstr "Le petit cochon est rentré à la « maison »."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Crispy."
msgstr "Croustillant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like an offering to the beast."
msgstr "On dirait une offrande à la bête."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Not so fancy now, pig!"
msgstr "Elle est moins grande maintenant, cochon !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "I can see a snout pressed up against the window."
msgstr "On dirait qu'un groin colle à la vitre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "These pigs have pretty fancy houses."
msgstr "Ces cochons ont de bien jolies cabanes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "Come ON! I know you're home!"
msgstr "Allez ! Je sais que t'es chez toi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "Ewwww, he smells!"
msgstr "Beurk, il pue !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "Someone should tell its family."
msgstr "Quelqu'un devrait prévenir sa famille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "You're part of my entourage."
msgstr "Tu fais partie de mes amis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "They kind of creep me out."
msgstr "Le genre de truc qui me fait froid dans le dos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "Looks serious."
msgstr "Il a l'air sérieux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Not a friendly pig!!"
msgstr "Un cochon pas amical !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt out."
msgstr "C'est brûlé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's hungry for meat."
msgstr "Il lui faut de la viande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "More stuff to make."
msgstr "Encore des trucs à faire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "It still has the tail on it."
msgstr "Il y a encore la queue dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "Smells like bacon."
msgstr "Ça sent le bacon !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "Sure looks cozy."
msgstr "Ça a l'air tout chaud."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "This'll pay off in a fight."
msgstr "Ça devrait servir lors d'un combat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "This looks important."
msgstr "Ça a l'air important."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "I can hear a tiny tree inside it, trying to get out."
msgstr "Je peux entendre un petit arbre à l'intérieur, qui essaie de sortir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "It'll be a tree soon!"
msgstr "Ça sera un arbre bientôt !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "Ahoy!"
msgstr "Ohé !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "I'm diggin' the decor."
msgstr "J'aime bien la décoration."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "Now I just need an angry mob to join."
msgstr "Je n'ai plus qu'à rejoindre une manifestation paysanne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "That doesn't look very appealing."
msgstr "Ça n'a pas l'air très appétissant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "At least it's warm now."
msgstr "Au moins elle est chaude maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT"
msgid "To understand the plant, you must wear the plant."
msgstr "Pour comprendre la plante, il faut porter la plante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Leafy!"
msgstr "Touffu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "Guh! It's growing so slowly!"
msgstr "Bouh ! Ça pousse si lentement !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Mmmm. Ready to harvest."
msgstr "Hmmm. Prête pour la récolte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "The heat killed it."
msgstr "La chaleur l'a tuée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
msgid "\"Authored by C.W.\""
msgstr "« Écrit par C.W. »"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH"
msgid "Hoof you seen this one yet?"
msgstr "Vous l'avez déjà vue, celle-là ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT"
msgid "Written by \"E.\"?"
msgstr "Écrit par « E. » ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL"
msgid "\"Brought to you by the Heralds of Tenebrau.\""
msgstr "« Présenté par les Hérauts de Ténébrau. »"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s looks shifty..."
msgstr "%s a un côté sournois..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Burning that wasn't very scientific, %s."
msgstr "Brûler ça n'était pas très scientifique, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "Salutations, %s !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "%s could use a heart."
msgstr "%s pourrait utiliser un cœur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer!"
msgstr "Assassin !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, friend of ghosts."
msgstr "%s, le compagnon des fantômes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC"
msgid "They're occupied."
msgstr "Cette personne est occupée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME"
msgid "I'm beside myself."
msgstr "Je suis hors de moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD"
msgid "It's fifty-one short of a deck."
msgstr "Il en manque cinquante-et-un pour faire un jeu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER"
msgid "I wonder if she got them second hand."
msgstr "Je me demande si elle les a trouvés à quatorze heures."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I bet there's a lot of interesting science inside."
msgstr "Je parie qu'il y a un tas de science passionnante, dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "I guess it needs time to... recalibrate the, uh... time whatsit."
msgstr "Je crois qu'elle a besoin de temps pour... recalibrer le... euh... truc temporel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS"
msgid "Wait a minute, this is starting to look more like magic than science!"
msgstr "Une minute... On dirait plus de la magie que de la science !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I bet there's a lot of interesting science inside."
msgstr "Je parie qu'il y a un tas de science passionnante, dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.MARKED_DIFFERENTSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.MARKED_DIFFERENTSHARD"
msgid "only_used_by_wanda other shard"
msgstr "only_used_by_wanda other shard"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.MARKED_SAMESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.MARKED_SAMESHARD"
msgid "only_used_by_wanda same shard"
msgstr "only_used_by_wanda same shard"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "It's doing \"time stuff\", that's the technical term."
msgstr "Ça fait des trucs temporels. Si si, c'est le terme technique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.UNMARKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.UNMARKED"
msgid "only_used_by_wanda unmarked"
msgstr "only_used_by_wanda unmarked"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD"
msgid "Onward, to discovery!"
msgstr "En avant vers de nouvelles découvertes !"

