#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
