msgstr "Il aime bien ma poche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
