#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Plutôt innovant pour un enfant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "I can't decide how I feel about them..."
msgstr "Je ne sais pas trop quoi en penser..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "Yuck."
msgstr "Beurk."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "Yuck."
msgstr "Beurk."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "How do they stand being so slow?"
msgstr "Comment font-ils pour être si lents ?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "As long as it protects me, I don't care what it looks like."
msgstr "Tant que ça me protège, je me fiche de l'apparence."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "Strange. Anyway, moving on..."
msgstr "Bizarre. Enfin bref..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I got some on the bottom of my shoe..."
msgstr "Oh flûte de zut, je crois que j'ai marché dans quelque chose..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "A handful of shattered shell bits."
msgstr "Une poignée de débris de carapace."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's no spring chicken."
msgstr "Et ça, c'est du poulet ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "What is it? Do you need to be fed again already?"
msgstr "Quoi ? Tu as déjà faim ? Encore ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Thank goodness. I can finally do things uninterrupted."
msgstr "Ouf, parfait. Je peux enfin faire ce qu'il faut sans être interrompue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Oh no, I forgot to feed you again didn't I?"
msgstr "Oh non, j'ai encore oublié de te nourrir, c'est ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST"
msgid "The poor little thing. It's too late for me to help them."
msgstr "Le pauvre... Je ne peux plus rien pour lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "A little meat is better than none."
msgstr "Un peu de viande, c'est mieux que rien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "A bite of tough, dry meat."
msgstr "Un morceau de viande séchée et dure à mâcher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "This one's got bite."
msgstr "C'est mordant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM"
msgid "There's always time for a snowball fight."
msgstr "On a toujours le temps pour une bataille de boules de neige."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Child's play. Not bad, though."
msgstr "Un jeu d'enfant. Mais ce n'est pas mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL"
msgid "Must admit I have a few ideas for this one."
msgstr "Je suis inspirée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "It's just as slow as the other kind."
msgstr "Il est aussi lent que l'autre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hopefully this won't take too long."
msgstr "J'espère juste que ça ne va pas être trop long."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "That's good enough, isn't it?"
msgstr "Ça suffit, non ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "This is taking an eternity!"
msgstr "Ça prend une éternité !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "I think it's finally done."
msgstr "Je crois que c'est enfin fini."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "He's a tough old thing."
msgstr "Il est vieux et robuste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "Don't think I won't use it if I have to!"
msgstr "Je n'hésiterai pas à m'en servir s'il le faut !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I could do a quick charge with that."
msgstr "Je pourrais exécuter une charge rapide avec ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "It gets to the point."
msgstr "Ça va droit au but."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "...I should try to stay on her good side."
msgstr "... Mieux vaut que je reste dans ses bonnes grâces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "I do hope I'm still on her good side..."
msgstr "J'espère qu'elle me considère comme une alliée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "I wonder if it makes time slow down, or if it's just well insulated."
msgstr "Je me demande si ça ralentit le temps, ou si c'est juste bien isolé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "Best used in minute amounts."
msgstr "Mieux vaut l'utiliser avec parcimonie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "Oh, that smell takes me back."
msgstr "Oh, cette odeur me rend nostalgique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "I'll just toss a pinch over my shoulder for good luck."
msgstr "Je vais juste en jeter une pincée par-dessus mon épaule pour me porter chance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "Delightfully sweet."
msgstr "Quel délice !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "I like them better this way."
msgstr "Je les préfère comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Why don't you just run along? Go do spider things."
msgstr "Et si tu me laissais tranquille ? Va donc faire des trucs d'araignée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "At least it's not causing any trouble."
msgstr "Au moins, elle ne pose pas de problème."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "A wise choice."
msgstr "Une sage décision."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I have a bad feeling about it."
msgstr "J'ai un mauvais pressentiment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "This was predictable."
msgstr "J'aurais dû m'en douter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "I'm not in any hurry to tangle with spiders."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas très envie d'aller câliner des araignées."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "He's certainly got a creative streak, doesn't he?"
msgstr "Il est sacrément créatif, non ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "I should squish them now, it'll save me the hassle later on..."
msgstr "Je devrais les écraser maintenant. Ça m'évitera bien des soucis plus tard..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "That spider left me a thoughtful parting gift."
msgstr "Cette araignée m'a laissé un beau cadeau d'adieu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "A lovely reminder of that time I was almost eaten by a giant spider."
msgstr "Ça me rappelle la fois où j'ai failli me faire manger par une araignée géante. Qu'est-ce qu'on a ri..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "I can hear them skittering inside..."
msgstr "Je les entends s'agiter, là-dedans..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "I can hear them skittering inside..."
msgstr "Je les entends s'agiter, là-dedans..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "Just whose idea was it to make the spiders here so big?! I'd like to have a word."
msgstr "Qui a eu l'idée de faire les araignées de cet endroit aussi grosses ?! J'aimerais me plaindre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "I hope I never see you again."
msgstr "J'espère ne plus jamais te revoir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "We should burn it, if I recall correctly."
msgstr "Je crois qu'il faut la brûler."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "A new cycle begins."
msgstr "Un nouveau cycle commence."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "You think you can get the drop on me?"
msgstr "Tu crois vraiment que tu peux me surpasser ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "They have terrible bedside manner."
msgstr "Je n'aimerais pas être malade chez elles..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "I'm afraid that won't do me any good."
msgstr "J'ai peur que ça ne m'aide pas beaucoup."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "Why don't you just skitter around the other way?"
msgstr "Et si tu filais dans l'autre sens, plutôt ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "That's the end of that."
msgstr "Bon ben. Kaput."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't think that spider was assembled properly."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression que cette araignée n'a pas été assemblée normalement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's still, for the time being."
msgstr "Ça ne bouge pas pour le moment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "I wish he used it more often."
msgstr "J'aimerais qu'il l'utilise plus souvent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Leave me alone!"
msgstr "Laisse-moi tranquille !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "I chose my survival over his."
msgstr "C'était lui ou moi. Et je préfère que ce soit moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh botheration, I hate the stripy ones."
msgstr "Oh, flûte de zut... Les rayées sont les pires."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "At least it's not causing any trouble."
msgstr "Au moins, elle ne pose pas de problème."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "Shoo! Why can't you just stay in your tree?"
msgstr "Ouste ! Reste dans ton arbre, toi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Oh, is he throwing a little spider party?"
msgstr "Oh, il organise une petite fête des araignées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Oooh that's rotten!"
msgstr "Ooooh, c'est pourri !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Food that once was."
msgstr "C'était autrefois de la nourriture."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "At least they brighten things up a bit."
msgstr "Au moins, elles embellissent un peu les environs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't start growing in there."
msgstr "J'espère que ça ne va pas se mettre à pousser ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "Careful now..."
msgstr "Attention..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Float along now."
msgstr "Va flotter ailleurs, toi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't start growing in there."
msgstr "J'espère que ça ne va pas se mettre à pousser ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "They're looking for a place to latch onto."
msgstr "Elles cherchent un endroit où s'accrocher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't start growing in there."
msgstr "J'espère que ça ne va pas se mettre à pousser ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "Could you light the way without being a nuisance, please?!"
msgstr "Est-ce que tu pourrais éclairer le chemin sans m'ennuyer ?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "If it keeps me from dying of heat exposure, I'm happy."
msgstr "Si ça m'empêche de mourir de chaud, ça me va."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "A tiny star, what could go wrong?"
msgstr "Une étoile miniature. C'est sans danger, n'est-ce pas ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I prefer keeping everything at a distance."
msgstr "Je préfère rester à distance de beaucoup de choses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Oh botheration, I thought it was a compass."
msgstr "Oh flûte de zut, je croyais que c'était une boussole."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "You'll never catch me! I've outsmarted you and your ilk at every turn!"
msgstr "Tu ne m'auras jamais ! Je ne me suis jamais laissé avoir par toi et ta clique !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "I know you're hiding in there."
msgstr "Je sais que tu te caches là-dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "I know you're hiding in there."
msgstr "Je sais que tu te caches là-dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "You'll never catch me! I've outsmarted you and your ilk at every turn!"
msgstr "Tu ne m'auras jamais ! Je ne me suis jamais laissé avoir par toi et ta clique !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "You've seen one rock, you've seen them all."
msgstr "Quand on a vu une pierre, on les a toutes vues."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Wow, amazing. Let's keep moving shall we?"
msgstr "Ouah, incroyable. On avance ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "This was a bad idea. I have regrets."
msgstr "C'était une mauvaise idée. Je regrette. Beaucoup."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "This was a VERY bad idea."
msgstr "C'était une TRÈS mauvaise idée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "Ack! Get out of here!"
msgstr "Argh ! Va-t'en !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC"
msgid "Have you finally learned your lesson?"
msgstr "As-tu enfin retenu la leçon ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "It looks like I'm not the only one who forgets where I put things."
msgstr "On dirait que je ne suis pas la seule à oublier où je mets mes affaires."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "It seemed like a good idea at the time."
msgstr "Ça me paraissait être une bonne idée, sur le moment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "I still haven't figured out who made this..."
msgstr "Je ne sais toujours pas qui a fait ça..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "It's curious how they all seem to be broken in the same spot..."
msgstr "C'est bizarre, elles ont toutes l'air cassées au même endroit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "There's just something about it..."
msgstr "C'est quand même très bizarre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "\"Someone\" had far too much time on his hands..."
msgstr "« Quelqu'un » avait beaucoup trop de temps libre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I can gawk at them later, they're not going anywhere."
msgstr "Je pourrais toujours m'extasier plus tard. Elles ne bougeront pas d'ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "I don't have much patience for art."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas la patience de m'intéresser à l'art."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "I've seen it before and I'll probably see it again."
msgstr "Une fois qu'on en a vu une, on les a toutes vues..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "I'm still not sure who left these here."
msgstr "Je ne sais toujours pas qui a laissé ces trucs ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "Some things are taken very literally around here."
msgstr "Certaines choses sont tout de même très littérales, ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "My poor hands are going to get callouses from all this sea-faring."
msgstr "Mes pauvres mains vont être pleines de cloques à jouer les marins comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "I hope I don't forget to add that to the boat."
msgstr "Il ne faut pas que j'oublie de mettre ça sur le bateau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "A bee sting that almost was."
msgstr "J'ai failli me faire piquer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe in my time, we called that a chair."
msgstr "De mon temps, je crois qu'on appelait cela une chaise."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "It is occupied."
msgstr "Elle est occupée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "A table. Will wonders never cease."
msgstr "Une table. L'émerveillement ne cessera donc jamais ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Yes, there is something on it."
msgstr "Oui, il y a quelque chose dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "Maybe its time had come."
msgstr "Son heure est peut-être venue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "It certainly saves time."
msgstr "Ça fait gagner du temps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "I could dress up like a farmer, how fun!"
msgstr "On dirait presque une fermière. Super."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "Vegetables inside and out."
msgstr "Des légumes dans un légume."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "I'm never too full for a little extra stuffing."
msgstr "J'ai toujours un peu de place dans l'estomac."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "I guess it's technically edible."
msgstr "J'imagine que techniquement, c'est comestible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED"
msgid "Smells lovely."
msgstr "Quelle douce odeur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "I'm afraid I can't stop to admire every bit of scenery."
msgstr "Malheureusement, je ne peux pas m'arrêter tous les deux mètres pour admirer le paysage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I can never seem to keep them alive for long."
msgstr "Je n'arrive jamais à les faire survivre longtemps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A shell this enormous must have something interesting inside."
msgstr "Un coquillage aussi énorme contient sûrement quelque chose de très intéressant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Oh botheration! Open up, you!"
msgstr "Oh, flûte de zut ! Allez, ouvre-toi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I could fit an entire bait shop in there."
msgstr "Je pourrais ouvrir un magasin de pêche, là-dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "Everything breaks down over time. Well, most things anyway."
msgstr "Tout s'use et se décompose avec le temps. Enfin, quasiment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "Time has not been kind."
msgstr "La roue du temps ne s'est pas montrée clémente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "I wonder how long it will last."
msgstr "Je me demande combien de temps ça tiendra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "Everything breaks down over time. Well, most things anyway."
msgstr "Tout s'use et se décompose avec le temps. Enfin, quasiment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Does anything last?"
msgstr "Existe-t-il quoi que ce soit d'éternel ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Hmph. Time will tell."
msgstr "Hmm. Le temps nous dira si ça tiendra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Oh! I thought that was done already."
msgstr "Oh ! Je croyais que c'était déjà terminé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Oh! I thought that was done already."
msgstr "Oh ! Je croyais que c'était déjà terminé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Perfect for people who can't make up their mind."
msgstr "C'est parfait pour les gens qui ne savent pas quoi choisir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "It looks like something a pretentious old professor might wear."
msgstr "J'imagine très bien un vieux professeur prétentieux porter ce genre de choses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "An odd recipe, but I can't say I don't enjoy it."
msgstr "C'est une recette étrange, mais plutôt savoureuse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "Well... I guess there's time for a quick cup of tea."
msgstr "Bon... Je pense que j'ai le temps de prendre un petit thé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Oh, I quite like that one."
msgstr "Oh, j'aime beaucoup celle-ci."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Dinner might have to wait."
msgstr "Le dîner attendra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "An empty table isn't really much to look at."
msgstr "C'est bien triste, une table vide..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "A finely set table."
msgstr "Une jolie table bien dressée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Oh botheration, what time of year is it again?"
msgstr "Oh flûte de zut, c'est déjà la saison ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Finally, my poor pockets can be free of hooks and fish bait."
msgstr "Mes pauvres poches vont enfin être débarrassées des hameçons et des leurres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "I don't think I've seen this type of tackle before. Or maybe I just forgot..."
msgstr "Je crois que je n'ai jamais vu ce genre d'hameçon. Ou alors j'ai oublié..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Fishing is so bothersome, it takes so much time and preparation!"
msgstr "Pêcher est une vraie corvée. Ça demande trop de temps et de préparations !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "I'll never forget, baba used to bring these home for us on special occasions."
msgstr "Ça me rappelle mon enfance... Papa nous en offrait toujours pour nos anniversaires."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "I wonder how they keep their balance."
msgstr "Je me demande comment ils font pour tenir debout."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "A future bird."
msgstr "Un futur oiseau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "It tastes like stolen time."
msgstr "C'est donc ça, le goût du temps volé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "I shouldn't leave it out in the cold."
msgstr "Je ne devrais pas le laisser dans le froid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Did that crack come from the outside or the inside?"
msgstr "Cette faille a été faite de l'extérieur ou de l'intérieur ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "It's going to be a fried egg soon if I don't cool it down."
msgstr "Il risque de cuire si je ne le refroidis pas très vite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "Can you hatch any faster?"
msgstr "Tu peux éclore plus vite, s'il te plaît ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "According to my egg timer, it could hatch any moment now!"
msgstr "Selon mon minuteur, cet œuf devrait éclore à tout moment !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I spot an egg! Although it looks like it was spotted already."
msgstr "Un œuf ! C'est mignon, ces taches."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "Just an empty nest."
msgstr "Un nid vide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "Eggs and breakfast sausage efficiently rolled into one."
msgstr "Des œufs efficacement enroulés dans une saucisse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "They're piping hot!"
msgstr "C'est brûlant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "When did you dye your feathers?"
msgstr "Tu as teint tes plumes ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Oh botheration, I bet you're hungry."
msgstr "Oh flûte de zut, tu as faim, c'est ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "This is no time for sleeping!"
msgstr "Ce n'est pas le moment de dormir !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "I think she might actually eat me if I don't feed her soon."
msgstr "Je crois qu'il va finir par me manger si je ne le nourris pas très vite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "I can't believe how much energy this thing requires to work."
msgstr "Ce truc a besoin d'une quantité considérable d'énergie pour fonctionner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "Well, might as well put it to use."
msgstr "Bon, autant l'utiliser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "With this I can surely pass through space and time!"
msgstr "Avec ça, je peux sûrement voyager dans le temps et l'espace !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "This appears to be a nexus to another world!"
msgstr "On dirait une liaison vers un autre monde !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "There's still something missing."
msgstr "Il manque encore quelque chose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "Soon, the invention will be complete!"
msgstr "L'invention sera bientôt achevée !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "This may control the polarity of the whole universe."
msgstr "Ça pourrait contrôler la polarité de tout l'univers."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "Tough enough to handle the most intense experiments."
msgstr "Assez résistant pour supporter les expériences les plus intenses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "This metal potato contains great and fearful power..."
msgstr "Cette patate en métal recèle un pouvoir énorme et terrifiant..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "A ring that could focus dimensional energies."
msgstr "Un anneau capable de concentrer les énergies dimensionnelles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "It's a bit clunky, but it'll do for now."
msgstr "C'est un peu maladroit, mais ça fera l'affaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "It looks like nap time is over, permanently."
msgstr "Bon, on oublie la sieste, alors."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess it wouldn't hurt to take a quick little nap..."
msgstr "Je ne dirais pas non à une petite sieste..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "I'll be avoiding that."
msgstr "Je vais éviter de m'en approcher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Quite a nasty weapon."
msgstr "Quelle arme effroyable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Such a nice pattern, if only it wasn't so slimy and disgusting."
msgstr "Quel joli motif... Dommage que ce soit aussi gluant et répugnant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "Another thing I probably shouldn't touch."
msgstr "Encore un truc que je ne devrais pas toucher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "I don't think I should touch that."
msgstr "À mon avis, mieux vaut que je n'y touche pas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Hateful little things!"
msgstr "Ces petites choses sont horribles !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "There's a whole maze of tunnels down there."
msgstr "Il y a tout un labyrinthe de tunnels, là-dessous."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It's dormant, for the time being at least."
msgstr "Pour l'instant, c'est inactif."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "Oh, it didn't take well to shadow magic, did it?"
msgstr "Oh, il n'a pas trop apprécié la magie des ombres, on dirait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "Being right all the time is getting old."
msgstr "Toujours avoir raison finit par être épuisant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Does anyone else feel that shiver of interdimensionality in the air?"
msgstr "Je suis la seule à sentir ce frisson interdimensionnel ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "It doesn't seem to be active, perhaps now I can tinker with it..."
msgstr "Ça n'a pas l'air de fonctionner. Je peux peut-être en profiter pour le bricoler."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "I have a rather terrible feeling about this..."
msgstr "J'ai vraiment un très mauvais pressentiment..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Erased from the timeline."
msgstr "Il a été effacé de cette ligne temporelle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Dimensional cross-contamination aside, it's quite a lovely chest."
msgstr "Si on fait abstraction de la contamination interdimensionnelle, c'est un très joli coffre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "That... seems suspect."
msgstr "C'est... suspect."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "If I could just break it down into more manageable pieces..."
msgstr "Si seulement je pouvais la séparer en pièces plus pratiques..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "I've seen this before."
msgstr "J'ai déjà vu ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "Just what I was looking for!"
msgstr "C'était pile ce que je cherchais !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "I don't trust it."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas confiance en lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "Oh don't look at me like that, it's nothing personal!"
msgstr "Oh, ne me regarde pas comme ça, ça n'a rien de personnel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Aha! I knew I remembered seeing orange ones!"
msgstr "Ha ha ! Je savais bien que j'en avais vu des orange !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "Did he lose the trail? Ugh, what a waste of time!"
msgstr "Il a perdu sa trace ? Argh, quelle perte de temps !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "He seems particularly interested in that area."
msgstr "Cette zone semble particulièrement l'intéresser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "Hmm, I suppose there's nothing around to track."
msgstr "Hmm, je suppose qu'il n'y a rien à pister dans les environs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "You've found something, have you?"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé quelque chose, on dirait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "Perhaps they're somewhere else."
msgstr "Ils sont peut-être ailleurs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "Having an expert around should speed things up."
msgstr "Pouvoir compter sur un expert devrait accélérer les choses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "They seem preoccupied with helping someone else."
msgstr "On dirait que celui-là aide quelqu'un d'autre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "That doesn't look like it belongs..."
msgstr "Ça n'a rien à faire ici..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "This plant gunk isn't going to do me much good."
msgstr "Cette substance végétale ne va pas m'aider."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED"
msgid "Smells lovely."
msgstr "Quelle douce odeur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "I really should have remembered something like you!"
msgstr "J'aurais vraiment dû me souvenir de toi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "I think the pendulum just swung in his favor..."
msgstr "On dirait que le pendule s'est balancé en sa faveur..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "Wasn't there something here before? Or maybe that's later."
msgstr "Il y avait quelque chose ici, non ? Ou alors ce sera pour plus tard..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "This feels strangely familiar."
msgstr "Ça me paraît étrangement familier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "Come on out, don't be shy!"
msgstr "Allez, sors de là ! N'aie pas peur !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "A pleasantly plump, juicy tomato."
msgstr "Une belle tomate bien mûre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Oh, it's gone all mushy."
msgstr "Oh, elle est devenue toute molle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I don't know if I can lift a tomato that size!"
msgstr "Je ne sais pas si je vais réussir à soulever une tomate de cette taille !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Why waste time growing them when I can just eat them now?"
msgstr "Pourquoi gâcher du temps à les faire pousser quand on peut juste les manger immédiatement ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "I'd look like quite the gentlewoman in that!"
msgstr "Je vais être sacrément classieuse, avec ça sur la tête !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "A bit drab for my tastes."
msgstr "C'est un peu terne à mon goût."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "It'll keep the darkness at bay. For a time, at least."
msgstr "Ça éloignera les ombres. Pour le moment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "This is exactly what I first imagined a mincemeat pie would be."
msgstr "C'est exactement comme ça que j'imaginais une tourte à la viande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Looks like it's ready to go."
msgstr "On dirait que c'est tout prêt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "A bit redundant, but it'll work in a pinch."
msgstr "C'est un peu répétitif, mais ça fera l'affaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "I might as well use it."
msgstr "Autant que je l'utilise."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It positively reeks of spacial wib-wobblery."
msgstr "Ça pue le paradoxe spatio-temporel. Mais bon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "I prefer the version that has little bits of candy in it..."
msgstr "Je préfère sa version avec des bonbons dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "He's got a strong arm on him."
msgstr "Il est du genre musclé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Is this one of those newfangled electric thinga-ma-whoosits?"
msgstr "C'est un de ces bidules électriques dernier cri ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "The trap is fine, it's the part afterwards that makes me sad..."
msgstr "Le piège fonctionne très bien. Et c'est bien ce qui m'attriste..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "If any intruders come by, they'll be in for a thorny surprise."
msgstr "Si des intrus viennent jusqu'ici, ils vont se retrouver dans une situation très épineuse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Now they're just harmless cobblestones."
msgstr "Ce ne sont plus que des pavés inoffensifs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD"
msgid "This should slow down anyone following me."
msgstr "Ça ralentira quiconque me suit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT"
msgid "You wouldn't catch me walking over that."
msgstr "Jamais je ne marcherais là-dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM"
msgid "A bit too hot for warming my feet."
msgstr "C'est un peu trop chaud pour se réchauffer les pieds."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "Ooooh you hateful thing!"
msgstr "Ooooh, sale bête !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not falling for that again."
msgstr "Je ne vais plus me laisser avoir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "That would be a painful misstep to make."
msgstr "Ce serait un faux pas qui me coûterait cher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "I'll want to avoid stepping on that!"
msgstr "Autant éviter de marcher là-dessus !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "I probably should have seen that coming."
msgstr "J'aurais sûrement dû le voir venir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Less cluttering up my pockets means less cluttering up my mind."
msgstr "Moins de bazar dans mes poches, c'est moins de désordre dans ma tête."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "I can always use more space for trinkets."
msgstr "J'ai toujours besoin de plus d'espace pour mes affaires."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Did I leave this here? Hm..."
msgstr "C'est moi qui ai laissé ça là ? Ah..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "It's almost like someone is trying to prevent me from going somewhere."
msgstr "On dirait presque qu'on cherche à m'empêcher d'aller quelque part."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "I can finally speed up those dreadfully slow trees!"
msgstr "Je peux enfin faire accélérer ces fichus arbres trop lents !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING"
msgid "The stone will fall any time now."
msgstr "La pierre devrait bientôt tomber."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED"
msgid "Time to mine."
msgstr "L'heure de la collecte est venue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like a quick job."
msgstr "Ça m'a l'air d'un boulot rapide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING"
msgid "It has its whole life ahead of it."
msgstr "Il a toute sa vie devant lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "I could plant this anywhere."
msgstr "Je pourrais le planter n'importe où."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "It makes such a racket!"
msgstr "Ça fait un sacré boucan !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "They look like candy that was left in someone's pocket for too long."
msgstr "On dirait des bonbons qui seraient restés trop longtemps dans des poches."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Thankfully my teeth seem to have stayed pretty sturdy in my older years."
msgstr "Heureusement, mes dents ont bien résisté au temps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Oh you would look just darling on a shelf next to some porcelain figurines!"
msgstr "Oh, j'aimerais beaucoup le mettre sur une étagère près de figurines en porcelaine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "It's stuck in a perpetual state of decay."
msgstr "C'est en décomposition et ça va le rester."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "Oooh, I do love a good knickknack."
msgstr "Oooh, j'adore les bibelots !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "It's just for display."
msgstr "Ça fera très joli dans un salon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "I have no patience for chess, but it looks simple enough."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas la patience d'apprendre à jouer aux échecs. Mais ça n'a pas l'air compliqué."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "I have no patience for chess, but it looks simple enough."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas la patience d'apprendre à jouer aux échecs. Mais ça n'a pas l'air compliqué."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "Think about how much time I'll save if I only need to use one utensil!"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que je gagnerais comme temps si je n'utilisais qu'un ustensile !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Has history taught us nothing?"
msgstr "L'histoire ne nous a-t-elle rien appris ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "Nobody's perfect."
msgstr "Personne n'est parfait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "I can't get a single note out of it."
msgstr "Je n'arrive pas à en tirer une seule note."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "So this is when it ended up!"
msgstr "Ah, mais il était là !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "It's seen better days."
msgstr "Il a connu des jours meilleurs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I'm neither a cat nor a knitter. Maybe someone else will want it."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas un chat et je ne tricote pas. Quelqu'un d'autre en voudra peut-être."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "I'll be able to shave a few seconds off my shoe-changing time."
msgstr "Ça va me permettre de gagner quelques secondes quand je change de chaussures."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "I'm not much of a cat person."
msgstr "Je n'aime pas trop les chats."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "It smells like pine needles. Dead, rotten pine needles."
msgstr "Ça sent le pin. Si ses aiguilles pourrissaient..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "Something to sip and snack on all at once!"
msgstr "Il y a à boire et à manger !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I would've rather found the coat."
msgstr "J'aurais préféré trouver le manteau qui était dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "It seems like you can't walk too far around here without tripping over a chess piece."
msgstr "On ne peut aller nulle part sans tomber sur une pièce d'échecs, par ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "It seems like you can't walk too far around here without tripping over a chess piece."
msgstr "On ne peut aller nulle part sans tomber sur une pièce d'échecs, par ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "I'm not going to bother trying to untangle it."
msgstr "Je ne vais même pas essayer de le dénouer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "I wonder whatever happened to the rest of the set. Or the players."
msgstr "Je me demande ce qui est arrivé au reste des pièces. Et aux joueurs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "I wonder whatever happened to the rest of the set. Or the players."
msgstr "Je me demande ce qui est arrivé au reste des pièces. Et aux joueurs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "It'll only show you one possible future."
msgstr "Ça ne montre qu'un seul futur possible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "I keep forgetting it's not real!"
msgstr "Je n'arrête pas d'oublier que ce n'est pas réel !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "There's no need to be afraid of curses if you're clever enough to outsmart them."
msgstr "Pas besoin d'avoir peur des malédictions quand on est assez malin pour les contourner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Whatever it held, it's gone now."
msgstr "Quoi qu'il y ait eu dedans, il n'y a plus rien, maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "I don't think it's a good idea to put things we find lying around here in our mouths."
msgstr "Je pense que ce n'est pas une bonne idée de porter ce qu'on trouve par terre à la bouche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Somewhere there's a vampire having a very bad day."
msgstr "À mon avis, il y a un vampire qui passe une très mauvaise journée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "It helps me see the way ahead."
msgstr "Ça m'aide à voir droit devant moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "I don't think it's from this timeline..."
msgstr "Je pense que ça n'appartient pas à la bonne époque..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "Oooh, I do love a good knickknack."
msgstr "Oooh, j'adore les bibelots !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "The needle moves rather sluggishly."
msgstr "L'aiguille est d'une lenteur...."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "This is definitely going to contaminate the timeline."
msgstr "Ça va perturber la ligne temporelle, ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "...But why does it have a mouse head?"
msgstr "... Mais pourquoi ça a une tête de souris ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Ah, youth..."
msgstr "Ah, la jeunesse..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "Is that plant still alive?"
msgstr "Elle est encore en vie, cette plante ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "It keeps making strange sounds."
msgstr "Ça n'arrête pas de faire des bruits bizarres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "How did this get here?"
msgstr "D'où vient ce truc-là ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "How futuristic!"
msgstr "C'est très futuriste !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "One of those electrical doo-hickeys. I'll stick to my gears and pendulums."
msgstr "C'est une de ces babioles électriques. Je préfère m'en tenir à mes rouages et mes pendules."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "I have no time for distractions."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas le temps de me laisser distraire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "You never know what might come in handy later."
msgstr "On ne sait jamais, ça pourrait se révéler utile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "Each one is charmingly unique."
msgstr "Chacun possède un charme bien à lui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "I would've thought the water from the fishbowl would help douse the flames..."
msgstr "Je pensais que l'eau de l'aquarium l'aurait empêché de brûler..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "I was too late to save it."
msgstr "Je suis arrivée trop tard."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "That's quite an extravagant fishbowl."
msgstr "C'est un aquarium très extravagant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "Poids : {weight}\nPêché par : {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nI'm amazed it fits in there!"
msgstr "Poids : {weight}\nPêché par : {owner}\nJe suis épatée qu'il rentre là-dedans !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid "It does give one a nice sense of achievement.\nWeight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "C'est satisfaisant.\nPoids : {weight}\nPêché par : {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nSee? I can be patient sometimes!"
msgstr "Poids : {weight}\nPêché par : {owner}\nVous voyez ? Je sais être patiente, parfois !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING"
msgid "Oh! Where did that fire come from?"
msgstr "Oh ! Comment ça a pu brûler ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr "Quel gâchis !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC"
msgid "You would think weight would be easier to manipulate than time..."
msgstr "Je pensais que le poids serait plus facile à manipuler que le temps..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nInteresting, there's a temporal bubble that keeps it from rotting."
msgstr "Poids : {weight}\nRécolte effectuée le jour : {day}\nIntéressant. Une bulle temporelle l'empêche de pourrir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nInteresting, there's a temporal bubble that keeps it from rotting."
msgstr "Poids : {weight}\nRécolte effectuée le jour : {day}\nIntéressant. Une bulle temporelle l'empêche de pourrir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT"
msgid "It won't even tell me the weight? Well that's just rude."
msgstr "Ça ne veut même pas m'indiquer son poids ? C'est insultant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Quite cozy."
msgstr "Une chaleur bien agréable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "The hair is just as thick on the inside."
msgstr "La fourrure est tout aussi épaisse dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "You get used to the flavor after a while."
msgstr "On s'habitue au goût, à force."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "Thoroughly cleaned, I hope."
msgstr "J'espère qu'elle a été bien nettoyée..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "In the interest of time, I didn't bother removing the fur."
msgstr "Je n'ai pas retiré la fourrure pour gagner du temps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "I'm sure it's seen a lot during its travels."
msgstr "À mon avis, il a vu des tas de choses lors de ses voyages."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION"
msgid "I've tampered with time, I guess I could tamper with the ground a bit too."
msgstr "J'ai manipulé le temps, alors je peux bien manipuler un peu le sol aussi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE"
msgid "Slightly more interesting to look at, but still just ground."
msgstr "C'est un peu plus intéressant à observer, mais c'est juste un sol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at the ground?"
msgstr "Pourquoi je perds mon temps à regarder le sol ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at... I'm sorry, is that rug made of whiskers?!"
msgstr "Pourquoi je perds mon temps à regarder ce... Euh, est-ce que ce tapis est fait à partir de poils de moustache ?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR"
msgid "I've missed carpet..."
msgstr "La moquette me manquait..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2"
msgid "Oh, what a lovely carpet!"
msgstr "Oh, quelle belle moquette !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at the ground?"
msgstr "Pourquoi je perds mon temps à regarder le sol ?"

