msgstr "Winona vit dans le futur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF"
msgid "Maybe it needs winding?"
msgstr "Il faut peut-être la remonter ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING"
msgid "That doesn't bode well for us."
msgstr "Ça n'annonce rien de bon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "I wonder how quickly she can build a new one..."
msgstr "Je me demande à quelle vitesse elle peut en construire une autre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "That young lady is a genius!"
msgstr "Cette jeune femme est un génie !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF
