msgstr "Gelée du diable !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE"
