msgstr "Bonne nuit, bébé steak."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "It has my back."
msgstr "Il me protège."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "Runny eggs... crisp bacon... I could die happy now..."
msgstr "Jaune d'œuf coulant... bacon frit... je peux mourir heureux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE"
msgid "What have I to lose?"
msgstr "Je n'ai rien à perdre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "How colorful!"
msgstr "Que de couleurs !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT"
msgid "It's... not exactly my style."
msgstr "Ce n'est... pas mon style."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY"
msgid "Ah! A celebration!"
msgstr "Ah ! Quelle fête !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED"
msgid "Quite an odd design. Then again, it was made by an odd fellow."
msgstr "C'est un modèle étrange. Après tout, ça a été créé par quelqu'un de tout aussi étrange."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "What a kind gift!"
msgstr "Quel beau cadeau !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "It's been left completely breathless."
msgstr "On lui a littéralement coupé le souffle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST"
