msgstr "Ça sent les œufs pourris."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "I do not wish to wait for what comes out!"
msgstr "Je préfère ne pas attendre de voir ce qui en sortira !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT"
msgid "Steaming as a method of cooking preserves nutrients and flavor!"
msgstr "La cuisson à la vapeur préserve les nutriments et la saveur !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA"
msgid "It smells of death and disease!"
msgstr "Ça pue la mort et la maladie !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE"
msgid "If you can't take the heat, climb the rope!"
msgstr "Quand on ne supporte pas la chaleur, mieux vaut grimper à la corde !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE"
msgid "Truly what I live for!"
msgstr "C'est vraiment ma raison de vivre !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "This, a grill and some meat and I'd have dinner."
msgstr "Ça, une grille et de la viande et j'ai mon dîner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND"
msgid "It needs an important ingredient."
msgstr "Elle a besoin d'un ingrédient très important."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER"
msgid "What a rude bird!"
msgstr "Quel oiseau désagréable !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN"
msgid "A play? Here?"
msgstr "Une pièce de théâtre ? Ici ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC"
msgid "Mon dieu... Is that the face I've seen peering from the shadows?"
msgstr "Diantre... Est-ce le visage que j'ai distingué dans les ombres ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST"
msgid "I have the feeling I am being watched."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression qu'on m'observe..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "Broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "Des pièces d'échecs cassées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "More broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "Encore des pièces d'échecs brisées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "And yet more broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "Encore des pièces d'échecs brisées ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR"
msgid "I think Maman would like this."
msgstr "Je pense que ça plairait beaucoup à ma maman."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION"
msgid "I do like her better like this."
msgstr "Je le préfère sous cette forme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "I can't believe we survived that beast!"
msgstr "Je n'arrive pas à croire qu'on ait survécu à cette bête !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED"
msgid "A second course of monster that I didn't ask for!"
msgstr "Un peu de rab' de ce monstre ? Je n'avais rien demandé !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "What a beautifully marbled steak."
msgstr "Quel steak magnifiquement persillé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Muse for my new honey glaze!"
msgstr "La muse qui m'a inspiré mon nouveau nappage au miel !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a bishop."
msgstr "On dirait un fou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "Mais ! Mais ça bouge !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "How lovely!"
msgstr "Que c'est joli !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "Looking at it is making me a little hungry..."
msgstr "Ça me donne un peu faim..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "At least this one won't try to sneak off with my lunch."
msgstr "Au moins, celui-là n'essaiera pas de se carapater avec mon repas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "I'm glad it's not trying to bite me."
msgstr "Heureusement qu'il n'essaie pas de me mordre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "I'm not sure why we memorialized this very scary creature."
msgstr "Mais pourquoi on a immortalisé une créature aussi effrayante ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING"
msgid "I'm getting a sudden craving for seafood."
msgstr "J'ai soudainement très envie de fruits de mer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER"
msgid "I have to admit, I think I prefer him this way."
msgstr "Je dois admettre que je le préfère comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "He put me off pork for some time."
msgstr "Il m'a réduit en purée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "It was much scarier in the flesh."
msgstr "Il faisait beaucoup plus peur en vrai."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED"
msgid "Brr... it still gives me the shivers..."
msgstr "Brr... J'en ai encore des frissons..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "How could I forget the chewing."
msgstr "Comment oublier cette mandibule."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "I was afraid I was going to be broiled alive!"
msgstr "J'ai eu peur de me faire dévorer vivant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Did it just blink?"
msgstr "Il vient de cligner de l'œil, non ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "This must be the king?"
msgstr "C'est sans doute le roi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3"
msgid "A three course fight I won't soon forget."
msgstr "Un combat où j'ai dégusté."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "One can dream."
msgstr "On peut toujours rêver."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON"
msgid "I think Mme. Wickerbottom is particularly fond of this one."
msgstr "Je pense que Mme Wickerbottom doit l'adorer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS"
msgid "A table centerpiece fit for a holiday feast."
msgstr "Un centre de table pour un festin de fêtes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a knight."
msgstr "On dirait un peu un cavalier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "Mais ! Mais ça bouge !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS"
msgid "I hope this won't bring us ill luck at sea..."
msgstr "J'espère que ça ne nous portera pas malheur en mer..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT"
msgid "As far as battles go, it was probably the most pleasant."
msgstr "C'était sans aucun doute la bataille la plus agréable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR"
msgid "Perhaps now you can keep watch over my crock pot."
msgstr "Vous pouvez peut-être garder un œil sur ma marmite ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON"
msgid "Hits my eye like a big pizza pie."
msgstr "J'ai cru voir une énorme pizza. Mais non."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1"
msgid "I should whip up some roast goose with cranberry sauce."
msgstr "Je devrais faire de l'oie rôtie aux airelles..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "This one looks like a queen."
msgstr "Celle-ci ressemble à une reine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "It looks a bit like a pawn."
msgstr "Ça ressemble un peu à un pion."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "I hope it doesn't set a bad example for the little ones."
msgstr "J'espère que ça ne montre pas le mauvais exemple aux petites pièces."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a rook."
msgstr "On dirait un peu une tour."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "Mais ! Mais ça bouge !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "It seemed to think it was top of the food chain."
msgstr "Il pensait être en haut de la chaîne alimentaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
msgid "If only I could use those bones in a broth."
msgstr "Si seulement je pouvais faire une soupe avec ces os."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL"
msgid "Stone mushroom soup anyone?"
msgstr "Une soupe de champignon de pierre, peut-être ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR"
msgid "They weren't the most polite guests, non?"
msgstr "Ce n'était pas la politesse qui les étouffait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "It comes in petit!"
msgstr "Elle est en pièces !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR"
msgid "That was a bad combination."
msgstr "C'était pas la bonne combinaison."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "The portable version."
msgstr "La version portable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED"
msgid "I'm relieved it's just a statue."
msgstr "Heureusement, c'est juste une statue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "It sure had an appetite."
msgstr "Il avait un sacré appétit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD"
msgid "Ah, the sweet taste of victory!"
msgstr "Ah, l'agréable goût de la victoire !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH"
msgid "It was really hot and cold with this one."
msgstr "C'était tout ou rien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "I remember the chewing."
msgstr "Je me souviens de sa mandibule."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "You look cute and inedible."
msgstr "T'es joli et immangeable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "The eye follows me wherever I go..."
msgstr "Ses yeux me suivent où que j'aille..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "It sleeps."
msgstr "Elle dort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Ah! Can this give me the storage space I crave?"
msgstr "Ah ! Est-ce que ça me donnera l'espace de stockage dont je raffole ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED"
msgid "It's quite horrible!"
msgstr "C'est assez répugnant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHUM"
msgid "I suppose fish don't have an especially sophisticated palate."
msgstr "J'imagine que les poissons n'ont pas de papilles délicates."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't eat me, I'm unseasoned!"
msgstr "Ne me mangez pas ! Je ne suis même pas assaisonné !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "Someone's a very talented sculptor."
msgstr "Il a été fait par un sculpteur de talent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not on the menu!"
msgstr "Je ne suis pas au menu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "It looks quite nice."
msgstr "C'est pas mal du tout."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "I should stoke the fire."
msgstr "Je devrais alimenter le feu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fire that cools?"
msgstr "Du feu qui refroidit ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "The flames climb higher!"
msgstr "Les flammes montent haut !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "It's getting low."
msgstr "Il faiblit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "I should like to sit by you for a moment."
msgstr "J'aimerais m'asseoir à tes côtés un instant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "I will have to light you again."
msgstr "Je vais devoir te rallumer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "I should stoke the fire."
msgstr "Je devrais alimenter le feu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Fire that cools?"
msgstr "Du feu qui refroidit ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "The flames climb higher!"
msgstr "Les flammes montent haut !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "It's getting low."
msgstr "Il faiblit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "I should like to sit by you for a moment."
msgstr "J'aimerais m'asseoir à tes côtés un instant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "I will have to light you again."
msgstr "Je vais devoir te rallumer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST"
msgid "I'm tired of the whole \"deconstructed\" trend."
msgstr "Cette tendance de la « déconstruction » me fatigue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East."
msgstr "Est."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Hmm, no reading."
msgstr "Hem... ça n'indique rien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
