msgstr "Maman adorait... adore les pique-niques."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
