#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.WARM"
msgid "It keeps my hands pleasantly warm."
