msgstr "Ce n'est pas la saison des champignons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "Oh, my mushrooms are beginning to grow!"
msgstr "Oh, mes champignons commencent à pousser !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
