msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY"
msgid "I'd better handle this one carefully."
msgstr "Je ferais mieux d'être prudent avec celui-ci."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY"
msgid "A heavy dish for a hefty fish, non?"
msgstr "C'est un repas copieux pour un gros poisson."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN"
msgid "A chef must have fresh ingredients, rain or shine!"
msgstr "Qu'il pleuve ou qu'il vente, un chef doit avoir des ingrédients frais !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW"
msgid "A chilly lure, purchased from an icy shopkeep."
msgstr "Un appât froid, acheté dans une boutique gelée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE"
msgid "Not very appetizing, but fish seem to like it."
msgstr "Pas très appétissant, mais ça a l'air de plaire aux poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN"
msgid "Not very appetizing, but fish seem to like it."
msgstr "Pas très appétissant, mais ça a l'air de plaire aux poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED"
msgid "Not very appetizing, but fish seem to like it."
msgstr "Pas très appétissant, mais ça a l'air de plaire aux poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE"
msgid "Not very appetizing, but smaller fish seem to like it."
msgstr "Pas très appétissant, mais ça a l'air de plaire aux petits poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN"
msgid "Not very appetizing, but smaller fish seem to like it."
msgstr "Pas très appétissant, mais ça a l'air de plaire aux petits poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED"
msgid "Not very appetizing, but smaller fish seem to like it."
msgstr "Pas très appétissant, mais ça a l'air de plaire aux petits poissons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD"
msgid "I wonder what deep sea delicacies are waiting for me?"
msgstr "Je me demande quelles merveilles gustatives me réserve l'océan."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1"
msgid "I've worked with worse looking ingredients."
msgstr "J'ai travaillé avec des ingrédients moins ragoûtants."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
msgid "You will make a fine fish dinner!"
msgstr "Je vais pouvoir faire de toi un plat digne de ce nom !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3"
msgid "Hm, I wonder if those spines are poisonous."
msgstr "Hmm, je me demande si ces piquants sont venimeux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4"
msgid "Ah yes, with a squeeze of lemon, some pepper..."
msgstr "Avec un peu de jus de citron et de poivre... Miam !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5"
msgid "Ah, some butter, some salt, and you'll be scrumptious!"
msgstr "Un peu de beurre, du sel, et tu seras délicieux !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6"
msgid "Its scales have such a lovely sheen."
msgstr "Ses écailles sont superbes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7"
msgid "Its scales have such a lovely sheen."
msgstr "Ses écailles sont superbes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8"
msgid "I prefer to use fresh fish, not frozen..."
msgstr "Je préfère cuisiner du poisson frais, et pas congelé..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9"
msgid "The meat has a subtle sweetness that makes for some interesting dishes."
msgstr "Sa chair a une sucrosité subtile qui peut rendre un plat très intéressant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1"
msgid "This will barely do as an appetizer!"
msgstr "Bon, ça pourra servir d'amuse-gueule..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2"
msgid "A tasty little morsel!"
msgstr "Un petit morceau de choix !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3"
msgid "Small, but surely delicious with the right accoutrements!"
msgstr "Il est petit, mais avec un bon accompagnement, il sera délicieux !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4"
msgid "I do wish I had bigger fish to fry."
msgstr "J'aurais aimé avoir un plus gros poisson à faire cuire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5"
msgid "Has this fish already been cooked?"
msgstr "Ce poisson a déjà été cuit ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6"
msgid "The meat has a dry, oddly brittle texture."
msgstr "Sa chair a une texture étrangement sèche et friable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7"
msgid "It's almost too pretty to eat... almost."
msgstr "Il est presque trop beau pour qu'on le mange... presque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8"
msgid "Mon dieu! I'll be the one cooked if I stay too close!"
msgstr "Mon Dieu ! C'est moi qui vais cuire si je reste trop près !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9"
msgid "I've never had food spit at me before."
msgstr "Jamais de la nourriture ne m'avait encore craché dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE"
msgid "To think they could grow this far out to sea!"
msgstr "C'est fou qu'ils puissent aller si loin dans l'océan !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT"
msgid "I don't think that will fit in my pocket..."
msgstr "Je pense que ça ne rentrera pas dans ma poche..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "A large souvenir from our travels at sea."
msgstr "Un grand souvenir de nos voyages en mer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE"
msgid "Sigh. Another grapeless vine."
msgstr "Ah là là... Encore une vigne sans raisin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON"
msgid "Perhaps I'll just leave that be."
msgstr "Je vais peut-être le laisser tranquille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp."
msgstr "Brûlé à en craquer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT"
msgid "Never know what I might find!"
msgstr "Qui sait ce que j'y trouverai ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL"
msgid "Someone is really stirring the soup."
msgstr "Ça a sacrément été touillé..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT"
msgid "Ah, fresh seafood!"
msgstr "Ah, des fruits de mer bien frais !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED"
msgid "It looks like there will be no fish for dinner tonight."
msgstr "On dirait qu'il n'y aura pas de poisson pour le dîner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED"
msgid "Ah, bon! It is fixed."
msgstr "Ah, très bien ! C'est réparé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "I prefer cooking fish to catching them."
msgstr "Je préfère cuisiner les poissons que les pêcher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED"
msgid "I can already smell my fish dinner simmering in butter sauce."
msgstr "Je sens déjà l'odeur du poisson qui mijote dans la sauce au beurre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT"
msgid "I will net us a feast!"
msgstr "Je vais nous ramener un festin !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing sadder than an empty dish!"
msgstr "Il n'y a rien de plus triste qu'un plat vide !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "That will do for now."
msgstr "Ça fera l'affaire pour l'instant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP"
msgid "Feast, my fishy friends! Plenty more where that came from."
msgstr "Régalez-vous, mes amis écailleux ! Il en reste plein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing sadder than an empty dish!"
msgstr "Il n'y a rien de plus triste qu'un plat vide !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "That will do for now."
msgstr "Ça fera l'affaire pour l'instant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP"
msgid "Feast, my fishy friends! Plenty more where that came from."
msgstr "Régalez-vous, mes amis écailleux ! Il en reste plein."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "What a racket!"
msgstr "Quel vacarme !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION"
msgid "Boasts as many uses as it has layers."
msgstr "On peut l'utiliser d'autant de façons qu'il a de couches."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "I would prefer to put this to better use."
msgstr "J'aurais préféré l'utiliser autrement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED"
msgid "You can never have enough onion."
msgstr "On n'a jamais trop d'oignons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "What fresh ingredients will grow from these?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que ça va me donner ? J'ai hâte !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "It glimmers like maman's eyes."
msgstr "Elle brille comme les yeux de ma maman."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "It makes me feel magical."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression d'être un sorcier !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "Here one minute, gone the next!"
msgstr "On se sait jamais quand il s'en va !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "I miss oranges..."
msgstr "Les oranges me manquent..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "This eye will keep an eye on things."
msgstr "Cet œil veillera au grain."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "When I hold it it makes the world feel... fast."
msgstr "Quand je le tiens le monde me paraît plus... rapide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTER"
msgid "Its meat must be both fishy and gamey."
msgstr "Sa viande doit avoir le goût de poisson et de gibier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't see anything there."
msgstr "Je ne vois rien ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT"
msgid "Shall we raid this pantry?"
msgstr "Devrait-on piller ce garde-manger ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD"
msgid "We are getting soggy."
msgstr "On est trempés."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "C'est dommage, it's not a fruit-bearing tree."
msgstr "C'est dommage, cet arbre n'a pas de fruits."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "Just a petite bébé."
msgstr "Ce n'est qu'un bébé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "It would make a fine serving plate."
msgstr "Ça ferait un très joli plateau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "It has only just begun to grow."
msgstr "Il commence à peine à pousser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "It's quite magnificent."
msgstr "C'est assez magnifique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "A traditional Italian Yuletide treat."
msgstr "Un mets italien traditionnel pour la nouvelle année."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "This will be music to something's ears."
msgstr "Ça va jouer de la musique aux oreilles de certains."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I could write down my recipes on this."
msgstr "Je pourrais écrire mes recettes là-dessus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "A perfect Pavlova!"
msgstr "Une pavlova parfaite !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "Not a very polite gentleman."
msgstr "Il n'est pas très poli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "A cool customer."
msgstr "Un client venu du froid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Mmm, that aroma!"
msgstr "Hmm, quel arôme !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is about to turn."
msgstr "C'est presque avarié."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "The meat is turning!"
msgstr "La viande va se perdre !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Finally, I can make my famous hot sauce!"
msgstr "Je peux enfin faire ma sauce épicée spéciale !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "I like to make my dishes pop!"
msgstr "J'adore que mes plats explosent en bouche !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "The roasting really brings out the flavors."
msgstr "La cuisson a révélé toutes ses saveurs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What an impressive pepper!"
msgstr "C'est un poivron impressionnant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "What fresh ingredients will grow from this?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que ça va me donner ? J'ai hâte !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "A fellow with excellent taste."
msgstr "Un camarade au goût exquis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "Would anyone like me to cool them down?"
msgstr "Est-ce que quelqu'un veut un peu d'air ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Overcooked."
msgstr "Trop cuit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I should give it something special."
msgstr "Je devrais lui faire une offrande spéciale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I should show some appreciation. I've eaten a lot of turkey legs."
msgstr "Je devrais lui rendre hommage. J'ai mangé beaucoup de pilons de dindes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "Mmmmm, pockets of palate punching pleasure!"
msgstr "Miam... une poignée de plaisirs croustillants !"

