msgstr "On finit par s'y faire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
