msgstr "Ça brûle !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
