msgstr "Ça commence à prendre forme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
