#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER"
