msgstr "Si je dois mettre la main à la pâte, autant le faire dans un certain confort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC"
msgid "It won't hold together much longer."
msgstr "Elle ne tiendra plus très longtemps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.HOT"
msgid "I despise working up a sweat..."
msgstr "Je déteste transpirer..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.LUKEWARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.LUKEWARM"
msgid "Without heat, it's hardly different from an ordinary garden hoe."
msgstr "Sans chaleur, ce n'est qu'une houe ordinaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM"
msgid "If I must do physical labor, I can at least do it in relative comfort."
msgstr "Si je dois mettre la main à la pâte, autant le faire dans un certain confort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Not quite enough for a rug."
msgstr "Insuffisant pour un tapis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "They grow up so fast."
msgstr "Ils grandissent si vite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "That is one persistent tail."
msgstr "Sa queue est têtue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "Try and get me now. Ha!"
msgstr "Essaie de m'attraper maintenant. Ah !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "Not so tough."
msgstr "Pas si balèze que ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "I suppose that's why there are no vampires around."
msgstr "Je suppose que ça explique l'absence de vampires."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "I wonder if it still wards away the undead."
msgstr "Je me demande si ça repousse encore les morts-vivants."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "An unreasonably enormous clump of garlic."
msgstr "Une énorme tête d'ail... ce n'est pas raisonnable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "Je suis supposé planter ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "It smells much nicer going in than coming back out."
msgstr "Ça sent bien meilleur que ça en a l'air."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "My pets! What has become of you?"
msgstr "Mes petits copains ! Que devenez-vous ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "Blegh."
msgstr "Peuh."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "This one is occupied."
msgstr "Celle-ci est occupée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Don't expect me to reach in there."
msgstr "Je refuse d'y mettre la main."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "Wilson can take it on a picnic."
msgstr "Wilson pourra l'emporter pour un pique-nique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "Somebody taste it first!"
msgstr "Je n'y goûterai pas en premier !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't trust that infernal jelly."
msgstr "Je ne me fie pas à cette gelée infernale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "Pass. I don't do sticky."
msgstr "Sans moi. Les trucs collants, c'est pas mon truc."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "The fuel needs a focus."
msgstr "Manque d'essence."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "This one's ready."
msgstr "Celui-ci est prêt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "The pragmatic approach."
msgstr "L'approche pragmatique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Apologies, Higgsbury. I thought that stench was coming from you."
msgstr "Désolé, Higgsbury. Je croyais que l'odeur venait de toi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It can't even die properly."
msgstr "Il ne peut même pas mourir correctement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "It communes with us through them."
msgstr "Il communie avec tout grâce à eux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED"
msgid "Not so tough now, are you?"
msgstr "Qui est le plus fort, au bout du compte, hm ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh. Empty."
msgstr "Peuh. Vide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "I think it would be best to keep my distance."
msgstr "Je pense que je ferais mieux de garder mes distances."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED"
msgid "Oh, bygones be bygones and such."
msgstr "Bah, n'en parlons plus, et ainsi de suite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "It remembers me!"
msgstr "Il se souvient de moi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "I hope they found peace."
msgstr "J'espère qu'elles sont en paix."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT"
msgid "Talk about a near death experience."
msgstr "C'est frôler la mort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "Apparemment, quelqu'un a joué avec les arts des ténèbres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "An elegantly wrapped social obligation."
msgstr "Une obligation sociale élégamment emballée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "For wrapping odds and ends..."
msgstr "Pour emballer des babioles..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "Entirely too gaudy."
msgstr "C'est bien trop voyant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "Must you make me chase you?"
msgstr "Faut-il vraiment que je te pourchasse ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Pretty brash for something so edible."
msgstr "Plutôt culotté de la part de quelque chose d'aussi comestible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "Not the castle I had in mind for myself."
msgstr "C'est pas le château de mes rêves."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "Sharp like my wit."
msgstr "Aussi aiguisé que mon intelligence."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "I hope I'm not so transparent."
msgstr "J'espère ne pas être aussi transparent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "A flying goop factory."
msgstr "Une usine à rejets volante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's drooling in its sleep."
msgstr "Il bave en dormant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "Flower power forever."
msgstr "Flower power pour toujours."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Flower power."
msgstr "Flower power."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Well, that's rank."
msgstr "Beuh... nauséabond."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "They're sticky."
msgstr "Ça colle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "What a nice change it is to know someone who cooks."
msgstr "C'est agréable de connaître quelqu'un qui cuisine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "It seems you've lost something, pal."
msgstr "On dirait que tu as perdu quelque chose, l'ami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "Shame about your horn, pal."
msgstr "Dommage pour ta corne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "We've come to an agreement."
msgstr "Nous avons trouvé un terrain d'entente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps it could be reasoned with."
msgstr "Je pourrais peut-être le raisonner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "Impressive."
msgstr "Impressionnant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "It's charged with nutrients."
msgstr "C'est bourré de nutriments."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Not my sort of fashion."
msgstr "Pas exactement mon style de beauté."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "It gets sharper with every cut."
msgstr "Elle s'aiguise à chaque coup."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "This must be game logic."
msgstr "Faut suivre la logique du jeu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "I'm not sure this was a good investment."
msgstr "Un bon investissement, vraiment ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "This shovel is worth a princely sum."
msgstr "Cette pelle coûte un bras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "A bit extravagant, don't you think?"
msgstr "C'est un peu extravagant, non ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "This was important to me once."
msgstr "Ça c'était important pour moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "I could use a pillow filled with these."
msgstr "Je pourrais en faire un coussin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "Needs manure."
msgstr "Il lui faut de l'engrais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Oops."
msgstr "Mince."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "What has brought this blight upon my world?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui provoque pareil gâchis dans mon monde ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Looks a little off, if you ask me."
msgstr "Il n'a pas l'air au mieux, si vous voulez mon avis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Tufty."
msgstr "Touffu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "Nothing to harvest."
msgstr "Rien à récolter."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "You'd think grass could withstand this heat..."
msgstr "Je pensais que l'herbe résisterait à cette chaleur..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "Quite a skittish creature."
msgstr "C'est une créature craintive."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It's sickly and frail."
msgstr "C'est faible et maladif."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm sure its tail grows back."
msgstr "Je suis sûr que sa queue repousse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "It's more \"pretty\" than \"dapper\"."
msgstr "Plus joli qu'élégant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Someone forgot to add the spirit."
msgstr "Quelqu'un a oublié d'y mettre un esprit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "I have to be nice to dead people now?"
msgstr "Il faut que je sois poli avec les morts, maintenant ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "I have a tendency to overdo it on the gravy."
msgstr "J'ai tendance à me servir copieusement en sauce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "A crutch for pitiful mortals without godlike powers. What?"
msgstr "Un soutien pour les misérables mortels qui n'ont aucun pouvoir divin. Quoi ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Only the nightmare fuel will unlock its true potential."
msgstr "Seule l'essence cauchemardesque libérera son plein potentiel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "It's useful for keeping in contact with my... acquaintances."
msgstr "C'est utile pour rester en contact avec mes... connaissances."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It is a focusing tool."
msgstr "C'est un outil de focalisation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "I should eat it."
msgstr "Je devrais le manger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Salty!"
msgstr "Salé !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Green fungus."
msgstr "Champignon vert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "When do those ones come up?"
msgstr "Ça pousse quand ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Been there. Done that."
msgstr "On s'occupe, on s'active."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "Don't expect me to wade in there for some wretched moon glass."
msgstr "Je refuse d'aller là-dedans pour mettre la main sur du verrelune maudit."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "I suppose it is quite picturesque."
msgstr "La vue est assez jolie, j'imagine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "There's a mole in the mix."
msgstr "C'est une recette pas trop dure."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "Disgusting!"
msgstr "Dégoûtant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Now THIS I like."
msgstr "Alors ça, j'aime bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Oh good, it's solid candy. I feared something healthy had snuck in."
msgstr "Oh, un bon bonbon ! J'ai eu peur que ce soit bon pour la santé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "No one is above enjoying a good lollipop."
msgstr "Qui n'apprécie pas une bonne petite sucette ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "Eating them makes me feel powerful."
msgstr "Manger ça me donne de la puissance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "Ah, maggots... how novel."
msgstr "Ah, des asticots... comme c'est original."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "It's not terrible."
msgstr "C'est pas terrible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "Only ruffians enjoy torturing themselves like this."
msgstr "Seules les brutes aiment se torturer à ce point."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Waxy, just like me."
msgstr "Ferme, exactement comme moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Who is making all this candy, exactly?"
msgstr "Mais qui fabrique tous ces bonbons, au fait ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Black licorice, my favorite."
msgstr "De la réglisse bien noire, c'est ce que je préfère."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "Almost endearing. Almost."
msgstr "Presque tentant. Presque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "A mystery I'm not keen on solving."
msgstr "Un mystère que je n'ai pas envie de résoudre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "I am much more disappointed than I thought I'd be."
msgstr "Je suis bien plus déçu que je ne l'aurais pensé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "No one is above enjoying a good lollipop."
msgstr "Qui n'apprécie pas une bonne petite sucette ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "How the tables have turned, worm."
msgstr "Joli retournement de situation, n'est-ce pas, le ver ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Takes away the horrors. But who would want that?"
msgstr "Ça éloigne les horreurs, mais qui en voudrait ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "Ah. This'll do the trick."
msgstr "Ah ! Ça suffira."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "Could be a little stronger."
msgstr "Ça pourrait être un peu plus fort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "Might as well throw it in the fire."
msgstr "Autant jeter ça au feu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "A fine pot of tea, with a side of mutation."
msgstr "Une superbe théière, avec un soupçon de mutation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "Oh joy. Is there really need for decoration?"
msgstr "Ah, merveilleux ! A-t-on vraiment besoin de décorations ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "Such a burden to carry it. If only there were a place to leave it."
msgstr "Quel fardeau ! Si seulement je pouvais laisser ça quelque part."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "I like the real ones better."
msgstr "Je préfère les vrais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "Shouldn't it be hanging from somewhere."
msgstr "Ça devrait être accroché quelque part."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "Ugh. These guys again."
msgstr "Beurk ! Encore eux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "Why do I hear \"Nevermore\"?"
msgstr "Pourquoi est-ce que j'entends « Plus jamais » ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "An undignified weapon for a less refined time."
msgstr "Une arme des temps passés qui manque de dignité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "It feels good to undo the work of others."
msgstr "C'est agréable de détruire le travail d'autrui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "I would never resort to something so brutish."
msgstr "Je ne m'en remettrais jamais à une chose si brutale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "What is the thread count on this?"
msgstr "C'est bio, au moins ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Looking at it is making me seasick."
msgstr "J'en ai le mal de mer..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "Can you rightfully call a sack of potpourri a pillow?"
msgstr "Peut-on vraiment considérer qu'un sac de pot-pourri peut servir d'oreiller ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "At least it will make a satisfying thwack."
msgstr "Au moins, ça fera un bruit satisfaisant en tapant avec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "You must be joking."
msgstr "C'est une plaisanterie ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "The dapperest of them all."
msgstr "La plus élégante de toutes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Just a bit of venom and some dirty old ash."
msgstr "Juste un peu de venin et de vieille cendre sale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "Must everything in this cursed place be either slimy or smelly or both?"
msgstr "Pourquoi tout est visqueux, odorant, ou les deux par ici ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE"
msgid "My skin has always been prone to burning."
msgstr "Ma peau a toujours été sensible aux brûlures."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "I could be persuaded to dabble in white magicks."
msgstr "Je pourrais me laisser tenter par la magie blanche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "Pleasantly cool."
msgstr "Agréablement frais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "It's almost too cold to hold."
msgstr "Presque trop froide pour être touchée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "A pocketful of stone and temperature."
msgstr "Un mélange de pierre et de température."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "It's almost too hot to hold."
msgstr "Presque trop chaude pour être touchée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "Comfortably lukewarm."
msgstr "Délicieusement tiède."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "The critics here will really eat you alive."
msgstr "Les critiques risquent de ne faire qu'une bouchée de vous, ici. Littéralement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Nice try."
msgstr "Bien essayé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "I have better things to do than being berated by an old crab."
msgstr "J'ai mieux à faire que de me laisser narguer par un vieux crabe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "Charlie always complained about being cold. Sigh."
msgstr "Charlie se plaignait toujours d'avoir froid. Pfff..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "Behold the frailty of our tender little minds."
msgstr "Regardez la fragilité de nos petits esprits."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "It certainly shakes out the cobwebs."
msgstr "Ça enlève les toiles d'araignées."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "Hmm, interesting."
msgstr "Hmm, intéressant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "Might need a few of these."
msgstr "J'en aurai peut-être besoin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Interesting cocktail."
msgstr "Un cocktail intéressant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "Rather refreshing."
msgstr "C'est rafraîchissant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "Why do healthy things always taste so... healthy."
msgstr "Pourquoi les choses saines ont toujours un goût... sain ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "That's depressing."
msgstr "C'est déprimant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "Hmph. I hope she appreciates this."
msgstr "Hmf. J'espère qu'elle apprécie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "Once again I find myself toiling away for that old crab."
msgstr "Me voilà encore à travailler pour ce vieux crabe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "Picky crab wants the perfect spot."
msgstr "Ce crabe exigeant cherche le coin parfait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "I don't understand this magic, but I respect it."
msgstr "Je ne comprends pas cette magie, mais je la respecte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "I can never decide what I want."
msgstr "Je n'arrive jamais à faire mon choix."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "Where's my tea?"
msgstr "Où est mon thé ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "I don't suppose she had insurance."
msgstr "J'imagine qu'elle n'avait pas d'assurance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "Where is that Pearl?"
msgstr "Où est Perle ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "Hm. Quite nice, actually."
msgstr "Hm. C'est pas mal, comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "It's of no use to me like this."
msgstr "Ça ne m'est d'aucune utilité en l'état."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "I miss a good long bath."
msgstr "J'ai envie d'un long bain."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "Yes, yes, under construction. What else is new?"
msgstr "Oui, oui, construction en cours. Ça n'avancera jamais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "It's an improvement."
msgstr "C'est une amélioration."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a sad little hovel."
msgstr "Quelle triste demeure."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "We're getting really comfortable around here."
msgstr "Les gens se permettent tout par ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Cute."
msgstr "Adorable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "How... quaint."
msgstr "Que c'est... pittoresque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "Nautical decor was never my style."
msgstr "La décoration nautique n'a jamais été mon style."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "Ah. I thought I'd run out of people to disappoint."
msgstr "Ah, moi qui croyais ne plus avoir personne à décevoir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "It's... strange to be so trusted."
msgstr "C'est... étrange qu'on me fasse confiance à ce point."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "Makes one feel like royalty."
msgstr "Avec ça, on se sent royal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "There's no place like it."
msgstr "Aucun endroit ne ressemble à celui-ci."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Somehow, it says even less now."
msgstr "C'est marqué... encore moins maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "\"You are here\"... I wish I wasn't!"
msgstr "« Vous êtes ici »... C'est justement le problème !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "This requires profundity."
msgstr "Ceci requiert de la profondeur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sticky and sweet."
msgstr "Collant et sucré."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "It's full of bee maggots."
msgstr "C'est plein de larves d'abeilles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Tender."
msgstr "Tendre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "These look childish, but they're delicious."
msgstr "On dit que c'est pour les enfants, mais c'est délicieux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "Call forth the beasts!"
msgstr "L'appel à la meute !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "That's the good stuff."
msgstr "Ça, c'est bon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE"
msgid "Luck? Sure, why not?"
msgstr "Un porte-bonheur ? Oui, pourquoi pas ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Hot as heck!"
msgstr "Chaud comme l'enfer !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "How posh."
msgstr "Comme c'est chic."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "It's of no use to me like this."
msgstr "Ça ne m'est d'aucune utilité en l'état."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "I miss a good long bath."
msgstr "J'ai envie d'un long bain."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "I could make use of that glass."
msgstr "Ce verre pourrait m'être utile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "They don't recognize me!"
msgstr "Ils ne me reconnaissent pas !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "Hungry devils, aren't they?"
msgstr "Des petits diables affamés, pas vrai ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "Bon débarras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish we'd get rid of that."
msgstr "Si seulement on pouvait s'en débarrasser."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's coming alive again!"
msgstr "C'est encore vivant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "It's a tunnel down to the hounds' nest."
msgstr "C'est un tunnel qui mène aux nids de molosses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "It could be used for fashion."
msgstr "Ça pourrait servir dans la mode."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "Houndstooth? Both deadly and debonair."
msgstr "Une dent de molosse ? Voilà qui est à la fois mortel et élégant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "Howl I ever find a use for this?"
msgstr "À quoi ça pourrait bien servir ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Stick your tongue in. You're getting slobber on my pantlegs."
msgstr "Rentre-moi cette langue. Tu vas baver sur mes vêtements."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Better him in that bowl than me."
msgstr "Plutôt lui que moi dans ce bol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "His spirit is free now."
msgstr "Son esprit est libre maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "Baby glaciers."
msgstr "Des bébés glaciers."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "Ice, ice, maybe."
msgstr "De la glace..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "It's melted."
msgstr "Ça a fondu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "It's melted."
msgstr "Ça a fondu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "A little piece of winter in a box."
msgstr "Un petit morceau d'hiver dans une boîte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Sundae, sundae, sundae!"
msgstr "La glace c'est classe !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "Strap some ice on your head."
msgstr "Un peu de glace sur la tête."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "I had a lot of surplus gems!"
msgstr "Il me restait un stock de gemmes !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Its contents are hibernating."
msgstr "Son contenu est en hibernation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "Cool staff."
msgstr "Bâton de fraîcheur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2"
msgid "Want to see a cool trick? I just need a volunteer..."
msgstr "Vous voulez voir mon nouveau tour ? J'ai besoin d'un volontaire..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3"
msgid "I'll show you a chilling display of magic."
msgstr "Je vais vous montrer une magie à glacer le sang."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Chilling."
msgstr "Rafraîchissant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I can see its true nature now!"
msgstr "J'en vois la vraie nature maintenant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "It only half-exists on this plane."
msgstr "Il n'existe qu'à moitié sur ce plan."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "How long has that old fool been hiding his trash here?!"
msgstr "Depuis combien de temps ce vieil imbécile cache-t-il ses déchets ici ?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "I still look dapper, right? As if I need to check."
msgstr "Je suis toujours aussi élégant, pas vrai ? Même pas la peine de vérifier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "Disgusting."
msgstr "Dégoûtant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "I nearly got my suit caught on those thorns!"
msgstr "Mon costume a failli s'accrocher dans ces épines !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "It's soiled my good gloves."
msgstr "Ça a taché mes jolis gants."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "I think there's seventeen in there."
msgstr "Je crois qu'il y en a dix-sept."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "Have I really been reduced to sifting through the trash?"
msgstr "J'en suis vraiment réduit à fouiller les poubelles ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT"
msgid "What's that? Worth the hassle?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que c'est ? Est-ce que ça en vaut bien la peine ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC"
msgid "One false move could send the whole pile tumbling down."
msgstr "Un geste de travers, et la pile s'effondre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "We couldn't even spare a little salt?"
msgstr "On ne peut même pas ajouter un peu de sel ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Cooked to perfection."
msgstr "Cuit à la perfection !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "Can I eat something that's not slimy for once?"
msgstr "Pourrais-je manger quelque chose qui n'est pas gluant, pour une fois ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "You really expect me to wear this?"
msgstr "Vous croyez vraiment que je vais porter ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "This was not an improvement."
msgstr "Ça ne s'améliore pas..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "Sadly, I've eaten worse out here."
msgstr "Hélas, j'ai mangé pire que ça, ici."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "What is that bee so angry about?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui énerve cette abeille ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "I've caught a tiger by the tail."
msgstr "J'ai attrapé un tigre par la queue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Whatever will we do without it."
msgstr "On fera sans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "Those creatures are so feeble of mind they can't tell a real bird from a wooden one."
msgstr "Ces créatures sont si faibles d'esprit qu'elles ne peuvent pas distinguer un véritable oiseau d'un volatile en bois."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "Surely someone else can set it up."
msgstr "Quelqu'un d'autre pourra sans doute l'installer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "A pity."
msgstr "Quel dommage !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "At least it should keep them occupied."
msgstr "Au moins, ça devrait les occuper un moment."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Physical labor is what underlings are for."
msgstr "C'est aux sous-fifres de s'occuper du travail physique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "No place to hide anymore."
msgstr "Vous n'avez plus d'endroit où vous cacher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A house for kitcoons? Can the pitiful little things not climb trees yet?"
msgstr "Une maison pour fatons laveurs ? Ces pathétiques petites créatures ne sont pas encore capables de grimper aux arbres ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "They are not here, they are out hiding."
msgstr "Ils ne sont pas ici, ils se cachent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "We are nearly out of time to find all of the rascals."
msgstr "Le temps pour trouver tous ces petits vauriens est bientôt écoulé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "I don't see why I need to build them a house. They need to learn to climb trees like adults."
msgstr "Je ne vois pas pourquoi je devrais leur bâtir une maison. Ils doivent apprendre à grimper aux arbres comme des adultes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It will likely grow up to pick my pockets."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Quand il grandira, il cherchera sans doute à me faire les poches."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. Those ears are ridiculous."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Ces oreilles sont ridicules."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It's encumbered by excess fur."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Sa fourrure en trop l'encombre de façon stupide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. Just looking at it makes me itch."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. J'ai envie de me gratter quand je le regarde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It smells of sulphur."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Il sent le soufre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It requires dental work."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Il a besoin d'un bon dentiste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "I've named so many creatures at this point, the novelty has worn off."
msgstr "J'ai nommé tant de créatures jusqu'ici que ça n'a plus rien de nouveau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It doesn't even have the grace of a catcoon."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Il n'a même pas l'élégance d'un chaton laveur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It's pretending to be a much more respectable beast."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique. Il se prend pour une bête bien plus respectable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature, and in such a gaudy outfit."
msgstr "Quelle petite créature pathétique, engoncée dans une tenue aussi tapageuse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "My, what a magnificently horrific creature."
msgstr "Mon Dieu, quelle créature magnifiquement atroce !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Magic has done things to this beast's horn."
msgstr "La magie a opéré sur les cornes de cette bête."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "What dark treasures lie within?"
msgstr "Quels sombres trésors cache-t-il ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "Such quality workmanship!"
msgstr "Un bel exemple de savoir-faire !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It looks beyond repair."
msgstr "Impossible à réparer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "Try to keep up."
msgstr "Essaie de tenir le rythme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "You are only as good as the company you keep."
msgstr "L'entourage en dit long sur quelqu'un."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "What is the matter with you?"
msgstr "C'est quoi, ton problème ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "What else can I say about this dirty carcass?"
msgstr "Que dire de plus sur cette carcasse infâme ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "A distant cousin of the beefalo."
msgstr "Un cousin éloigné du bœufalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "It has its winter coat on."
msgstr "Il a mis son manteau d'hiver."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "I hope it was well cleaned before we stuffed the figs inside."
msgstr "J'espère qu'elle a été bien nettoyée avant d'être farcie de figues."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "You won't catch me!"
msgstr "Tu ne m'attraperas pas !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "It's really light."
msgstr "C'est vraiment léger."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "I hope it keeps Them away."
msgstr "J'espère que ça les éloignera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "They're acceptable."
msgstr "C'est passable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Quite a clunky looking thing."
msgstr "Ça m'a l'air bien déglingué."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "Seems heavy."
msgstr "Ça a l'air lourd."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "It is nearly useless."
msgstr "C'est presque inutile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "Swiftly useless."
msgstr "Vite inutile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "It offers a serviceable amount of protection."
msgstr "Ça offre une petite protection utilisable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "This was intended for someone physically-inclined."
msgstr "Ça a été conçu pour quelqu'un d'assez physique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "Decent protection that will enhance my power."
msgstr "Une protection décente qui augmentera ma puissance."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "A little extra armor never hurt."
msgstr "Un peu d'armure supplémentaire ne nuit jamais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "We must destroy that Battle Standard."
msgstr "Nous devons détruire cet étendard de combat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "That thing's still shambling about, I see."
msgstr "Cette chose est encore là à traîner des pieds..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "You seem severely deluded, good sir."
msgstr "Vous m'avez l'air à côté de la plaque, mon bon seigneur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "You'd need a thick neck to wear such a thing."
msgstr "Il faut avoir le cou costaud pour porter ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "You shall serve us."
msgstr "Tu nous serviras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "I must have it."
msgstr "Il me faut ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "Horsefeathers."
msgstr "Des plumes de cheval."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "Not really my style."
msgstr "Pas vraiment mon style."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "I could use the invigoration."
msgstr "Je ne dis pas non à l'invincibilité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "Self sufficiency in wreath form."
msgstr "Autosuffisance en guirlande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "Too brutish for my tastes."
msgstr "C'est trop grossier à mon goût."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "A key is key."
msgstr "Une clé est une clé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "Right as rain."
msgstr "En pleine forme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "That is not suited to me."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas pour moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "I have no desire to use that."
msgstr "Je n'ai aucune envie d'utiliser ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Meddling with it will only cause further trouble."
msgstr "Toucher à ça ne fera qu'aggraver les choses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Let us end this chapter of our journey."
msgstr "Fermons ce chapitre de notre voyage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "It will quickly restore my powers."
msgstr "Ça va restaurer mes forces rapidement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "It's a one-way portal."
msgstr "C'est un portail à sens unique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'd never wear such an undapper thing."
msgstr "Je ne porterai jamais une chose aussi inélégante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "A decent wreath, should I feel like healing."
msgstr "Une couronne décente, en cas de besoin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "Foul beast! Know your place!"
msgstr "Bête immonde ! Reste chez toi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "It's no threat in this state."
msgstr "Dans cet état, ça ne fait pas peur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's alive in there."
msgstr "C'est vivant là-dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "I knew I would make a terrible pa-pa."
msgstr "J'ai toujours su que j'aurais fait un très mauvais papa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "I can say with pride that it is comfy and cozy."
msgstr "Je peux dire avec fierté qu'il est installé confortablement."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "It's happy with me, and I with it."
msgstr "Elle est contente avec moi, et avec ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "You're not a hellbeast, are you? Nooo. Just misunderstood!"
msgstr "Tu n'es pas une créature de l'enfer, n'est-ce pas ? Non. J'avais mal compris !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "It's hungry. Why is it hungry?"
msgstr "Elle a faim. Pourquoi a-t-elle faim ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "I think it's going to die!"
msgstr "Je crois qu'elle va mourir !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "The lavae's baby tooth."
msgstr "Une dent de lait de laviole."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "It's cold and dry now."
msgstr "C'est froid et sec maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Spitfire."
msgstr "Ça crache le feu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "A touch hot, but it could cook my food in a pinch."
msgstr "Un peu chaud, mais je pourrais y préparer le dîner en un clin d'œil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "With each day I get a little boulder."
msgstr "C'est presque un grocher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "Exceptionally mediocre."
msgstr "C'est exceptionnellement médiocre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "How pedestrian."
msgstr "Tout à fait banal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "I appreciate the attempt at presentation."
msgstr "Au moins, la présentation est convenable. J'apprécie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "Disgusting creature!"
msgstr "Dégoûtante créature !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "How very folksy."
msgstr "Comme c'est rustique !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "Disgusting creature!"
msgstr "Dégoûtante créature !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "This fungus survived the downfall."
msgstr "Ce champignon a survécu à la chute."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "Who would put this filth in their veins?"
msgstr "Qui s'injecterait pareille saleté dans les veines ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "It will run out eventually."
msgstr "Elles finiront par s'éteindre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "Oh good. The island is crawling with vermin."
msgstr "Formidable. L'île grouille de vermines."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "It does the job, I suppose."
msgstr "J'imagine que ça fait le boulot."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "Finally, a mutation that's actually useful."
msgstr "Enfin une mutation réellement utile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Chaaarge!"
msgstr "Chargez !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "What's it always chewing on?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qu'elle a à mâchouiller comme ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "It'd make a nice horn."
msgstr "Elle ferait une jolie corne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Energy flows through it."
msgstr "C'est plein d'énergie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "A little bit of protection."
msgstr "Un peu de protection."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "A chip off the old block."
msgstr "Un fragment de l'autre gros machin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "I like the noise they make when you burn them."
msgstr "J'aime le bruit qu'ils font en brûlant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "It's got a face."
msgstr "Il a un visage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Ah. A chance to grow something horrible."
msgstr "Ah ! Une chance de faire pousser un truc horrible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Just days away from dreadful."
msgstr "Encore quelques jours et ça sera atroce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "Ah, I do enjoy the finer things."
msgstr "Ah, j'aime vraiment les mets les plus fins."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "Finally, something to suit my refined palate."
msgstr "Enfin quelque chose digne de mon palais délicat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "Well. That was fun while it lasted."
msgstr "Bon, on s'est bien amusé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a piece of wood. What more is there to say?"
msgstr "Un bout de bois. Que dire de plus ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "Hmph, they let just anyone be a lord these days."
msgstr "Hmpf, n'importe qui se prend pour un seigneur, de nos jours."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "Je ferais mieux de ne pas y toucher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10"
