#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT"
