#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "It is not pleased."
msgstr "Elle n'est pas contente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Gone with the fire."
msgstr "Il est parti en fumée."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "Its movement appears to be hypnotic to the kittens."
msgstr "Ses mouvements semblent hypnotiser les fatons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "Materials to construct entertaining toys for kittens."
msgstr "Des matériaux pour construire des jouets afin de divertir les fatons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "Unfortunately, it's useless now."
msgstr "C'est hélas inutile, maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "I used to have one of those back home."
msgstr "J'en avais un comme ça, chez moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Materials to construct entertaining toys for kittens."
msgstr "Des matériaux pour construire des jouets afin de divertir les fatons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "It seems the kittens have lost their residence."
msgstr "Il semblerait que les fatons ont perdu leur demeure."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A well-constructed habitation for the kittens."
msgstr "Un foyer accueillant pour les fatons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "The kittens are currently attempting to hide."
msgstr "Les fatons sont en train d'essayer de se cacher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "The kittens' hiding game will come to an end soon."
msgstr "Le jeu de cache-cache de fatons se termine bientôt."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "Materials to construct a proper kitten household."
msgstr "Des matériaux pour construire une demeure digne des fatons."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "Oh dear, you are quite adorable."
msgstr "Oh, que tu es mignon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "They possess large ears to facilitate hunting small desert critters."
msgstr "Ils possèdent de grandes oreilles pour leur permettre de chasser de petites créatures du désert."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "It appears to have developed a form of camouflage."
msgstr "Il a manifestement développé une sorte de camouflage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "Oh dear, have you been startled?"
msgstr "Oh, as-tu été surpris, mon petit ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "This feline has quite an uncanny appearance."
msgstr "Ce félin a une apparence bien étrange."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "A feline? From the moon? Quite fascinating..."
msgstr "Un félin de la lune ? Fascinant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "Ah, it does bring back memories of my dear old cat..."
msgstr "Ah, ça me rappelle des souvenirs de mon vieux chat..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "Hmm, their body language seems to imply annoyance."
msgstr "Selon leur langage corporel, on dirait que je les ennuie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "The resemblance to a Panthera tigris is incredible."
msgstr "Sa ressemblance au Panthera tigris est extraordinaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "Oh dear, the bell truly augments your... cuteness. Ho ho!"
msgstr "Diantre, le grelot améliore grandement ta... mignonnitude. Ho ho, j'ai inventé un mot !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "It uses its powerful olfactory sense to locate prey."
msgstr "Il utilise son puissant odorat pour localiser ses proies."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Hmm. Quite a sturdy antler."
msgstr "Hmm... Une ramure assez solide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "How curious."
msgstr "Comme c'est curieux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "An automatic equine."
msgstr "Un Equus caballus automatisé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Its nightmare fueled surroundings have corrupted its programming."
msgstr "Son environnement plein d'essence cauchemardesque a déréglé sa programmation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "It follows me on account of the particular garb I wear."
msgstr "Il me suit en raison de la tenue particulière que je porte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "It is pledged to another."
msgstr "Il prête allégeance à quelqu'un d'autre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "This is a decidedly unruly breed!"
msgstr "Cet animal est sacrément turbulent !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "This creature has expired."
msgstr "Cette créature a trépassé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "Koalefanta Proboscidea."
msgstr "Koaléfantea proboscidea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "Koalefanta Proboscidea in thick winter pelage."
msgstr "Koaléléphantidé proboscidien dans son épais pelage d'hiver."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "High in protein and fiber."
msgstr "Elle est riche en protéines et en fibres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "It's a mythological holiday monster."
msgstr "Un monstre de vacances mythologiques."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "It seems bigger inside than out."
msgstr "Il a l'air plus gros à l'intérieur qu'à l'extérieur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "A refuelable light source."
msgstr "Source de lumière rechargeable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "Delightfully crispy."
msgstr "C'est croustillant. Délicieux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Best for someone on the receiving end of harsh attacks."
msgstr "Convient mieux à celui qui reçoit de rudes attaques."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "I'll leave that to one of the younger folks."
msgstr "Je vais laisser ça aux plus jeunes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "Light, but not particularly protective."
msgstr "Léger, mais pas vraiment protecteur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "The lightweight material grants the wearer better mobility."
msgstr "Ce matériel léger confère plus de mobilité à celui qui le porte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "This ought to prevent grievous harm from befalling the wearer."
msgstr "Celui qui la porte est censé éviter les blessures graves."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "I can't say it would be much use to me."
msgstr "Je ne peux pas dire que ça me serait très utile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "A weave of magic replenishes the wearer's will."
msgstr "Une vague de magie restaure la volonté de celui qui la porte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "Safety first."
msgstr "La sécurité d'abord."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "That banner is invigorating nearby enemies."
msgstr "Cette bannière revigore les ennemis alentour."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "Fascinating. It is animated, even here."
msgstr "Fascinant. Même ici, il est animé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "He has a chip on his shoulder, though I couldn't say why."
msgstr "Il a comme des cornes sur les épaules, mais je ne saurais dire pourquoi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "Goodness, I've no desire to wear such a thing."
msgstr "Grand Dieu ! Je n'ai aucune envie de porter chose pareille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "It is bound to our service."
msgstr "C'est destiné à nous servir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "An enviable magic relic, I must say."
msgstr "Une relique magique qui fait envie, je dois l'avouer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "A weak enchantment is present on this wreath."
msgstr "Un faible charme est présent sur cette couronne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "I prefer my books."
msgstr "Je préfère mes livres."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "This will amplify the effects of incoming healing magic."
msgstr "Ceci amplifiera les effets de la magie de soin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "Proximity to the blossoms produces a restorative effect for the user."
msgstr "Se trouver proche d'une floraison provoque un effet reconstituant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "Goodness. I could never lift that!"
msgstr "Bonté divine ! Je ne soulèverai jamais ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "It requires a key."
msgstr "Il faut une clé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "All ready for activation."
msgstr "Prêt pour l'activation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "How brutish."
msgstr "Comme c'est brutal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "Quite the unusual axe."
msgstr "C'est pas une hache ordinaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It is linked to our Gateway, but inactive on this side."
msgstr "C'est lié à notre Portail, mais c'est inactif de ce côté."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Well, this was an unexpected foray."
msgstr "Quelle drôle d'excursion ce fut !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "A focal point for magical energies."
msgstr "Un point de concentration des énergies magiques."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "It seems to facilitate local teleportation."
msgstr "On dirait que ça facilite la téléportation géographique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'll leave that to someone a tad more spry."
msgstr "Je vais laisser ça à quelqu'un de légèrement plus alerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "This strengthens the wearer's restorative magicks."
msgstr "Renforce la magie de restauration quand on le porte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "I believe it is a larval dragonfly."
msgstr "Je crois que c'est une libellule à l'état larvaire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "A domestication opportunity, I'd say."
msgstr "Une possibilité de domestication, selon moi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "A large macrolecithal egg."
msgstr "Un gros macrolécithal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "The temperature of this egg is below optimal."
msgstr "La température de cet œuf est en deçà de la température optimale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "This egg is at a suitable temperature for hatching."
msgstr "Cet œuf est à une température favorable à l'éclosion."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "I have to admit it is rather appealing."
msgstr "Je dois admettre que c'est plutôt attirant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "A healthy larval dragonfly."
msgstr "Une libellule de lave en pleine forme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "This creature is hungry."
msgstr "Cette créature a faim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "This creature requires sustenance immediately!"
msgstr "Cette créature a besoin d'être sustentée immédiatement !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "An egg tooth used by a baby reptile to break out of its egg."
msgstr "Une dent d'œuf utilisée par un bébé reptile pour briser sa coquille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "It's cooled down, almost like basalt."
msgstr "Ça s'est refroidi, c'est presque du basalte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Its saliva is similar to molten lava."
msgstr "Sa salive ressemble à de la lave fondue."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "Molten rock. Best not to get too close."
msgstr "De la roche en fusion. Mieux vaut ne pas s'approcher."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "Recently cooled igneous rock. Dangerous."
msgstr "Une roche ignée refroidie depuis peu. C'est dangereux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "Such an unusual flavor!"
msgstr "Quel goût surprenant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "At least I shouldn't have to worry about it being undercooked."
msgstr "Au moins, il n'y a pas à s'inquiéter de la cuisson."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "It seems to be made from a plant-based gelatin of sorts."
msgstr "On dirait que c'est fait à partir d'une gélatine de plante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "I... don't even know."
msgstr "Je... je ne sais pas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "I believe it requires the application of a flame."
msgstr "Je suppute que l'application d'une flamme est requise."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "I... don't even know."
msgstr "Je... je ne sais pas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "A symbiote! A fungus and a phycobiontic bacteria."
msgstr "Un symbiote ! Mélange de champignon et de bactérie phycobionte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "The mold appears to have medicinal properties."
msgstr "Il paraît que ça a des propriétés médicinales."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Is this animal or vegetable?"
msgstr "Animal ou végétal ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "Their translucent shells allow the bioluminescence of their bodies to shine through."
msgstr "Leur carapace translucide permet de voir la bioluminescence de leur corps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Ah, a mechanical tool for fire starting. How useful."
msgstr "Ah, un outil mécanique pour allumer un feu. Très pratique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "If it could be convinced to stay still, it would make an excellent reading light."
msgstr "Si on pouvait le convaincre de rester immobile, il ferait une très bonne lampe de chevet."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Quite keen."
msgstr "Vraiment portée sur l'électricité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "A variant of Capra aegagrus, keen on electricity."
msgstr "Une variante de Capra aegagrus portée sur l'électricité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "There must be something unnatural in the horn."
msgstr "Il doit y avoir quelque chose de pas naturel dans la corne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Radiant electrical energy!"
msgstr "Énergie électrique rayonnante !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Highly conductive!"
msgstr "Très conducteur !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "The juvenile is not as aggressive."
msgstr "Les petits sont moins agressifs."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "This log is special."
msgstr "Cette bûche est spéciale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "This tree is special."
msgstr "Cet arbre est particulier."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "The root cutting of a beastly tree."
msgstr "Le tranchant de racine d'un arbre bestial."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Ah. Its horror has taken root."
msgstr "Ah ! Cette horreur a pris racine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "I'd almost forgotten what real food tasted like."
msgstr "J'avais presque oublié le goût d'un vrai bon plat."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "How decadent."
msgstr "Quelle décadence !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "An axial section of tree trunk. On fire."
msgstr "Une section axiale du tronc. Ça brûle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "An axial section of tree trunk."
msgstr "Une section axiale prélevée sur le tronc."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "I have no patience for garden pests!"
msgstr "Je n'ai pas assez de patience pour m'occuper des nuisibles du jardin !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
msgid "How odd... perhaps it's merely a mirage."
msgstr "Étrange... ce n'est peut-être qu'une illusion."

