msgstr "Je crois que ces oiseaux bizarres aiment les décorations."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3"
