msgstr "Un chevalier mécaniquement mort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "Dead windup priest."
msgstr "Un prêtre mécaniquement mort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "Dead windup castle."
msgstr "Une tour mécaniquement morte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR"
msgid "It's hard to burn stuff at sea."
msgstr "C'est difficile de brûler des trucs, en mer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION"
msgid "Can't shake anything up like that."
msgstr "On fait moins le malin, hein ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "Those are some pointy teeth."
msgstr "Ça c'est des dents pointues."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED"
msgid "I guess I'd be cranky too if I was woken up from the Big Sleep."
msgstr "Ah bah, moi aussi je serais grognon si on me sortait de mon hibernation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Hey, they got his good side!"
msgstr "Hé, ils ont trouvé son meilleur profil !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Took the sting out of her stinger."
msgstr "Ça risque moins de piquer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "Just some dumb bishop piece."
msgstr "Juste des morceaux d'un fou stupide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "I don't wanna see what comes outta that!"
msgstr "Je ne veux pas voir ce qui sortira de ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "Meh. I can't even burn it."
msgstr "Pfff, je ne peux même pas le brûler."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "Now all I can think of is roasted carrots."
msgstr "Je pense à des carottes rôties, du coup."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "Heh. I like this one."
msgstr "Hé hé. Je l'aime bien, lui !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "It almost looks friendly."
msgstr "Il a presque l'air sympa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "It doesn't look so tough now."
msgstr "Il n'a plus l'air si costaud !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING"
msgid "Was the treasure worth it?"
msgstr "Le trésor valait le coup, au moins ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER"
msgid "How come jerks always seem to get statues?"
msgstr "Pourquoi c'est toujours aux gros nazes qu'on fait des statues ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "Another one?! This jerk gets another statue?"
msgstr "Encore ?! Il a droit à une autre statue ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "We kicked its butt."
msgstr "On lui a botté les fesses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED"
msgid "We kicked its butt, and then we kicked it again."
msgstr "On lui a botté les fesses, et ensuite, on a recommencé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "Still gross."
msgstr "Pas moins dégueu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "I think... I think I understand art."
msgstr "Je crois... je crois que je comprends l'art."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "I still feel an evil presence watching me..."
msgstr "Je sens encore une présence maléfique m'observer..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "I'm not afraid of that guy. He doesn't even have arms!"
msgstr "Il ne me fait pas peur. Il n'a même pas de bras !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3"
msgid "Ugh, I'd be happy never seeing that thing again."
msgstr "Berk, j'espère que ne je ne reverrrai plus jamais ce truc."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "Ouchhh! I think I chipped a tooth."
msgstr "Ouille ! J'ai dû m'ébrécher une dent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON"
msgid "I wanna push it over."
msgstr "J'ai envie de le pousser..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS"
msgid "Haha, you can't get me now."
msgstr "Ha ha, tu m'auras pas, comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A horse with no butt."
msgstr "Un cheval sans fesses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "I don't wanna see what comes outta that!"
msgstr "Je ne veux pas voir ce qui sortira de ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS"
msgid "She was a pretty tough old bird."
msgstr "C'était un oiseau féroce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT"
msgid "Good times."
msgstr "Ah, c'était l'bon temps."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR"
msgid "Pfft, I never needed a guardian. And I turned out fine!"
msgstr "Pff, j'ai jamais eu besoin de gardien, moi. Et je m'en suis très bien sortie !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON"
msgid "I guess it's nice."
msgstr "Faut croire que c'est joli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1"
msgid "Looks as dumb as the real thing."
msgstr "Il a l'air aussi idiot que le vrai."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "Ewww, she doesn't have a head!"
msgstr "Beurk... elle n'a pas de tête !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "What sort of peasant doesn't have a torch?!"
msgstr "Quel genre de paysan se baladerait sans fourche ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "I prefer smokey fires."
msgstr "Je préfère les feux qui fument."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "That one looks like it could do some damage."
msgstr "On dirait que celle-ci pourrait causer des dégâts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "I don't wanna see what comes outta that!"
msgstr "Je ne veux pas voir ce qui sortira de ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "Reminded me of someone from my old neighborhood."
msgstr "Ça me rappelle un ancien voisin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
msgid "Not so tough now, are you?"
msgstr "C'est qui le plus fort, finalement ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL"
msgid "What are you looking at?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu regardes comme ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR"
msgid "Great, another creepy statue."
msgstr "Super, encore une statue flippante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "Not so tall now, huh?"
msgstr "On n'est plus si grand, hein ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR"
msgid "That thing was the worst."
msgstr "J'ai jamais rien vu d'aussi nul."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "Stupid killer robot."
msgstr "Stupide robot tueur."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED"
msgid "I SAID we should've burned it, but nope, nobody listens to me..."
msgstr "J'avais bien dit qu'il fallait le cramer, mais on m'écoute jamais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "I hope it gets indigestion."
msgstr "Je lui souhaite une belle indigestion."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD"
msgid "Too many boats, not enough fire."
msgstr "Trop de bateaux, pas assez de flammes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH"
msgid "It could be a real jerk sometimes."
msgstr "Il est vraiment pas sympa des fois."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "Still gross."
msgstr "Pas moins dégueu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "He's so fuzzy!"
msgstr "Il est tout poilu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's rude to stare."
msgstr "Fixer les gens c'est impoli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "At least it's not looking at me anymore."
msgstr "Au moins, il me fixe plus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "More space to stash stuff? Sounds good to me!"
msgstr "Plus d'espace pour ranger des trucs ? Ça me va !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED"
msgid "Kinda nasty."
msgstr "Un peu vicieux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHUM"
msgid "Ew, fish eat that nasty stuff?"
msgstr "Beurk... les poissons mangent ce truc, non ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "This dog is stone cold!"
msgstr "Ce chien est complètement froid !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "Welp, that's a weird shape for a rock."
msgstr "Ah ! Drôle de forme pour une pierre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "How'd you get your eyes to do that?!"
msgstr "Faut avoir quoi comme yeux pour faire ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "Did someone carve this thing?"
msgstr "Quelqu'un a vraiment sculpté ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "Uh oh. It's almost gone!"
msgstr "Oh oh... presque éteint !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "I like fire of all kinds."
msgstr "J'aime tous les types de feu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "BURN! BURN FASTER! AND BLUER!"
msgstr "Brûle, brûle ! Plus vite ! Plus bleu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "This fire is small and boring."
msgstr "Un petit feu pas folichon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "Burn!"
msgstr "Brûle !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "Awww. It's all over."
msgstr "Oh... c'est terminé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "Uh oh. It's almost gone!"
msgstr "Oh oh... presque éteint !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I could watch it for hours, even though it's cold."
msgstr "Je pourrais le regarder pendant des heures, même s'il est froid."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "BURN! BURN FASTER! AND BLUER!"
msgstr "Brûle, brûle ! Plus vite ! Plus bleu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "This fire is small and boring. And blue."
msgstr "Un petit feu pas folichon. Et bleu en plus !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Burn!"
msgstr "Brûle !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "Make the fire come back!"
msgstr "Fais revenir le feu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST"
msgid "Nice, free stuff!"
msgstr "Trop cool, c'est gratuit !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East!"
msgstr "Est !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Can't get a reading."
msgstr "Ça n'indique rien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N"
msgid "North!"
msgstr "Nord !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE"
msgid "Northeast!"
msgstr "Nord-est !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW"
msgid "Northwest!"
msgstr "Nord-ouest !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S"
msgid "South!"
msgstr "Sud !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE"
msgid "Southeast!"
msgstr "Sud-est !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest!"
msgstr "Sud-ouest !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West..."
msgstr "Ouest !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOST"
msgid "Nah, I'm good."
msgstr "Nan, ça ira."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED"
msgid "I guess it looks okay? For a pile of rotten dirt?"
msgstr "Ça a l'air d'aller, pour un tas de terre pourrie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "Pas mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY"
msgid "Is it supposed to be that dry?"
msgstr "C'est censé être aussi sec ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Ew, why do we have this?"
msgstr "Berk, c'est quoi, ça ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET"
msgid "It's all wet and gross."
msgstr "C'est trempé et répugnant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP"
msgid "That's disgusting!"
msgstr "C'est dégoûtant !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS"
msgid "I'd rather burn things down than build them up."
msgstr "Je préfère brûler des trucs qu'en construire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK"
msgid "Uuugh, it's no fun cooking with instructions!"
msgstr "Pffff, c'est pas drôle de cuisiner en suivant une recette !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "The fire didn't get rid of its face. Gives me the willies."
msgstr "Le feu n'a pas détruit son visage. Ça me fout les chocottes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "Unseasoned meat... great."
msgstr "De la viande non assaisonnée... génial."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "It's still gross."
msgstr "Toujours aussi écœurant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "Gonna need a lot of appetizers to survive out here!"
msgstr "Il va me falloir un paquet d'amuse-gueule pour survivre ici !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER"
msgid "Hey! What are you lookin' at?!"
msgstr "Hé ! Tu veux ma photo ?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT"
msgid "Matches my prickly personality."
msgstr "Ça me va bien, je trouve."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL"
msgid "Ha, I stole its house."
msgstr "Ha, j'ai volé sa maison."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Can't read it, into the fire it goes!"
msgstr "J'arrive pas à la lire. Allez hop, au feu !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "At least it went out in a blaze of glory."
msgstr "Au moins, elle est partie en flammes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "The fire still has quite a bit of work to do."
msgstr "Le feu a encore du pain sur la planche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "The fire is doing its thing!"
msgstr "Le feu fait son œuvre !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Fire makes everything better. Mmm!"
msgstr "Le feu améliore tout. Miam !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "All food must be cleansed with fire."
msgstr "Toute nourriture doit être nettoyée par le feu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COOLANT"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "Dégoûtant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "I've kept stranger things than that."
msgstr "J'ai gardé des trucs plus bizarres que ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "A sweet vegetable, yum!"
msgstr "Un légume sucré, miam !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "Ooh, this one explodes when it goes in fire!"
msgstr "Oh oh ! Quand on le met dans le feu ça pète !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Let's get this thing on the fire!"
msgstr "Et si on y mettait le feu ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
