msgstr "Pfff, ça fait super coincé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
