msgstr "Hé, elle nous aide, celle-là !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
