msgstr "Il se détend."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
