msgstr "Tu regardes quoi, oiseau bizarre ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE"
