msgstr "BEURK ! C'est quoi ce truc ?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
