msgstr "Une citrouille sans tête."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
