msgstr "C'est un homme qui brûle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
