msgstr "Ça me dépasse !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
