msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18"
msgid "There's something unnatural aboot that thing... wouldn't ya say, Luce?"
msgstr "Ce truc a quelque chose de... pas naturel. Hein, Lucy ?"

