#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_cawnival"
msgid "Sparkling shrubbery is the best choice for growing berries."
msgstr "Un massif étincelant est le meilleur choix pour faire pousser des baies."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_mystical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_mystical"
msgid "An enchanting bush for growing berries on a moonlit night."
msgstr "Un buisson enchanteur pour faire pousser des baies par une nuit lunaire."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_swamp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_swamp"
msgid "Psst, berries grown in moss are the sweetest."
msgstr "Psst, les baies qui poussent dans la mousse sont les plus douces."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_waxed_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_waxed_cawnival"
msgid "Sparkling shrubbery is the best choice for growing berries."
msgstr "Un massif étincelant est le meilleur choix pour faire pousser des baies."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_waxed_mystical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_waxed_mystical"
msgid "An enchanting bush for growing berries on a moonlit night."
msgstr "Un buisson enchanteur pour faire pousser des baies par une nuit lunaire."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_waxed_swamp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.berrybush_waxed_swamp"
msgid "Psst, berries grown in moss are the sweetest."
msgstr "Psst, les baies qui poussent dans la mousse sont les plus douces."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_adventure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_adventure"
msgid "This cage's bold design will impress even the bird it imprisons."
msgstr "Le design audacieux de cette cage impressionnera même les oiseaux qu'elle emprisonne."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_circus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_circus"
msgid "Circus freak not included."
msgstr "Monstre de cirque non inclus."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_curly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_curly"
msgid "Maybe a pretty cage will help the bird come to terms with its imprisonment. Probably not though."
msgstr "Si la cage est jolie, peut-être que l'oiseau supporte mieux son emprisonnement. Ou peut-être pas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothic"
msgid "Trap birds in a prison of their own making."
msgstr "Ça piège les oiseaux avec des morceaux d'oiseau."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothicp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothicp"
msgid "Trap birds in a prison of their own making."
msgstr "Ça piège les oiseaux avec des morceaux d'oiseau."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_ornamental
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_ornamental"
msgid "Imprison a bird in a wreath of seasonal cheer."
msgstr "Enfermez un oiseau avec des guirlandes de saison."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_pirate"
msgid "The birds' swashbuckling days are over, thanks to this pirate-themed birdcage."
msgstr "Les jours truculents de l'oiseau touchent à leur fin grâce à cette cage sur le thème des pirates."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_romantic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_romantic"
msgid "Perhaps the bird will enjoy its stay."
msgstr "L'oiseau appréciera peut-être son séjour."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdtrap_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdtrap_an"
msgid "A cage even the birds will admire."
msgstr "Une cage que même les oiseaux admireront."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate"
msgid "A bare-bones design for the penny-pinchin' privateer."
msgstr "Un design rudimentaire pour un corsaire avare."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate_item
